\id JOS  
\h Joshua 
\toc1 Joshua Lekhabu 
\toc2 Joshua 
\toc3 Joshua 
\mt1 JOSHUA  
\mt2 LEKHABU  
\mt3 Joshua Lekhabu Sung Thu Umdan  
\ip Na thilgon losamna umkha em? Israel te ana losam uve… Tahsan lhahsamna le thungai louna jeh in kum somthum le get jen athilgon'u lolhing jou louvin ana tang'un ahi. Hiche jou chun phat kilemchang khat ahung um'in, hichu alhaso tapouve! Thungai toh thon ache tauvin ahileh gal mite ajouvun phat sottah ana nga jing’u alungtup uchu molson aum tan ahi.  
\ip Joshua lekhabu hi hopnin akihom khen'in, amasapa hin hansanna, tahsan, thil kidang tah-tah chule gal mite jona thudol aseijin ahi. Lungtup ahilouleh thilgon khat molso kiti hi boltheina jeh ahipon, let le neo jong ahipon chule nei le gou jeh jong ahipoi. Amavang Pathen tahsan le Ama thungaija bou kingam ahi!  
\ip Joshua lekhabu hop nina chan hin Pathen tohgon akijom peh in—itobang gim le hesoh dinmun hijongleh Pathen'in amite adalha ngaipon, ama-ama nam sunga chamna le thudih a akhosahna diuvin gam le go kicheh tah apen ahi. Hiche lekhabu nasim’a kon a hi Pathen'in nam som le ni ho chunga thilgon kicheh tah anei na simdoh ding kitilkhouna a nanei thei ding ahi. Hiche bang chun Pathen'in mimal cheh chunga thilgon aneiye, ti akicheh in ahi.  
\is1 Lekhabu Jihpa Chule Ajih Kum  
\ip Lekhabu hi Johsua in anajih ahi. Chule achaina lam Joshua thi-opna thudol hi Aaron chapa Eleazar thempu in ajih ahi. Hichu 1390 BC vel’a kijih ahi.  
\c 1  
\s1 Pathen'in Joshua Atilkhou  
\p
\v 1 Pakai lhacha Mose athi phatnin, Nun chapa Mose lhacha a pang Joshua kom'a chun Pakaijin thu ahin seijin,  
\v 2 “Ka lhacha Mose athitai. Hijeh chun nangma kipat inlang hiche Jordan hi galkaijin, nang le hiche mipi ho hin Keiman Israel chate kapehna gam hi jonlut tauvin.  
\v 3 Mose kom'a kana teppehna bang-banga chu hoilai mun hijongleh na kengphang’un achot phahna muntin chu nangho kapeh ding nahiuve. \x + \xo 1:3 \xt Danbu Ni Na 11:24,25\x*  
\v 4 Gamthip gam le Lebanon gam'a vadunglen chan gei, Eupharates vadung, Hit mite gam pumpi chuleh nisa lhumna lang twikhanglen chan gei nagam’u hi ding ahi.  
\v 5 Na hinkho lhumkei uva na masang uva koimacha ding joulou ding, Mose kana dinpi banga nangho jong kadinpi jing diu, ka dalhah louhel diu chuleh kanungsun louhel ding nahiuve. \x + \xo 1:5 \xt Danbu Ni Na 31:6,8; Heb 13:5\x*   
\p
\v 6 Hat inlang hangin, hiche mite hi peh dinga apu apateu kana teppeh gam chu agoulo diuva na hoppeh ding ahi. \x + \xo 1:6 \xt Danbu Ni Na 31:6,7,23\x*  
\v 7 Hat inlang hang pou-pouvin, Ka lhacha Mose kana peh danthu jouse nanit jouna dingin, hichea kon hin jetlang hihen veilang hijongleh kiheimang hihbeh in, chutileh na chena channa na khantou thei ding ahi.  
\v 8 Hiche danthubu hi nakam'a kon mangthah louhel ding, amavang asun ajanna nagel joh ding, akijih dungjuiya hi nachon jing diu ahi. Chitile bou na khantou ding chuleh na lolhin tei ding'u ahi.  
\v 9 Keiman thupeh kahinpeh louva nabol ham? Hat inlang hangin, kicha hihbeh in, tijatna jong neihih in ajeh chu Pakai na Pathen'in na chena chan uva na lhonpi jing dingu ahi,” ati.   
\s1 Joshua’n Israel te Atohdiu Aseipeh  
\p
\v 10 Chujou chun, Joshua’n mipi lamkaiho chu thu apen hitin aseije,  
\v 11 “Ponbuh sunga khun cheuvin lang mipi ho khu aneh diu akigot toh dingun gaseipeh un, ajeh chu nithum sunga hi Jordan luipi khu na galkai uva Pakai na Pathen'in napeh u gam khu galo tauvin.”  
\v 12 Chuleh Reuben phung leh Gad phung chuleh Mannasseh phung akehkhat ho kom'a chun Joshua’n hitin aseije, \x + \xo 1:12 \xt Minbu 32:28-32; Danbu Ni Na 3:18-20; Joshua 22:1-6\x*  
\v 13 “Pakai lhacha Mose’n nakom uva asei chu sumil hih un, 'Pakai na Pathen uvin na kicholdo sah tauvin, chuleh hiche gam hi napeh u ahitai.'  
\v 14 Najiteu le na chateu, chuleh na gancha teu chu Mose’n napeh nau hiche Jordan solam gamkaiyah hin umsah un, ahinlah nalah uva gal-hat ho leh mihangsan chengse chun gal manchah akipat uva asopihou masanga hi gal lamkaija pang diu,  
\v 15 Pakaijin nangho gam napeh bang uva amaho jong alodiu gam apeh kahseuva nakithopi diu ahi. Chujou tengleh nahung kileuva Pakai lhacha Mose’n napehnau Jordan solam nagam uva nachen diu ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Hiti chun ama hon Joshua chu adonbut un, “Ipi hileh nangin nei thupeh jouseu chu kabol diu, chuleh nei sol-sol nauva chu kache jeng diu ahi atiuve”.  
\v 17 “Keihon Mose thu kana ngai bang- bang uva chu imalam jousea nangma thu jong kangai diu ahi. Pakai na Pathen chun Mose ana umpi bang bangin nang jong naumpi jinghen,” atiuve.  
\v 18 “Koi hileh nangma thupeh jouse chu nit louva aum'a, nahin dou uva aum pou-pou leh thadoh jeng ding ahi. Hat inlang hangpou pouvin!”   
\c 2  
\s1 Rahab In Gam Velhi a Cheho Ahuhdoh  
\p
\v 1 Joshua’n Shittim’a kon'in aguh’a gam velhi dingin mini ana soldoh in hiti hin ana vailhah in ahi. Chelhon inlang Jericho geijin agam chu gakholpeh lhon'in ati. Hiti chun amani ache lhon'in Rahab notinu in'a agalhung lhon'in hichea chun aga geh lhon tan ahi. \x + \xo 2:1 \xt Heb 11:31; Jac 2:25\x*   
\p
\v 2 Hiche chu Jericho lengpa kom agalhut tauvin, “Ven, hiche gam kholtoh dingin Israel mi phabep tujanin ahung uve,” aga tiuvin ahi.  
\v 3 Hichun Jericho lengpan Rahab kom'a chun mi asol'in hiti hin aga seisah e: “Hiche gamsung velhi dinga hungho na inna hunglut ho chu hin puidoh in” atin ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Rahab chun mi teni chu ana sel ahinai, ahinla aman ana donbut in, “Amani chu ahung lhonnai ahin hoiya konna hung lhon ham ti keiman kahepoi.  
\v 5 Kho ahung jinkon kelkot kikha ding koncha khun apotdoh lhontai, hoilangpen ajot lhon ham keiman kahepoi, delloi leuchun naphah diu ahi,” ati.  
\v 6 Ahinlah amanun amani chu indan chunglanga apui touvin patkung lom inchunga ana phou lah achun asellin ahi.  
\v 7 Hiche jou chun lengpa sepai ten Jordan panmun lampi geijin aga nungdel’un ahi. Anungdel ho chu apotdoh jou jouvun Jericho khopi kelkot chu akhah tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Gam velhi teni jan alup masang lhon'in, Rahab inchunga amani chu kihoulimpi dingin akaltouvin,  
\v 9 ajah lhonnah hitin aseije, “Pakaijin hiche gam hi nangho napeh u ahitai ti keiman kahei, nangho ginnan eilodim tauvin, hiche gam mite hi nangho kichatna a tijagam kahi tauve.  
\v 10 Ajeh chu Egypt gam'a konna nahung potdoh u chun Pakaijin nangho dingin Twipi San akansah in, chuleh Jordan luigal langa um Amor leng teni Sihon le Og na suhmanghel'u jong chu kana jauvin ahi. \x + \xo 2:10 \xt Potdohbu 14:21; \xt Minbu 21:21-35\x*  
\v 11 Hiche thu hi kajah jeh un kalungu hi alhalhop jengin, nangho kimaitopi ding hi koima angapcha um talou ahi. Ajeh chu Pakai na Pathen uhi thaneitah, chunga van le noiya lei Pathen ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Hijeh chun, keiman nangni kakithopi lhon bang’a hi nangnin jong kei le ka insung mite hi khotona nei neilhon ding hinam Pakai minin kihahsel lhon’in lang,  
\v 13 hiche Jericho khopi hi nalah tengu leh, kapa le kanu, kasopi pasal ho le kasopi numeiho, ka insung mite jouse le keima nei hinghoi diu hinam amelchihna khat neipe lhon'in ati.   
\p
\v 14 Amanin adonbut lhon'in, nangin nei seidoh lhonlou pouleh na insungu hoidohna dingin keini hinkho hi kakitepna lhon ahi jeng'e. Pakaijin hiche gam hi eipeh tengu leh kakitepna lhon dungjuiya khotona kahin nei diu ahi ati lhon'e.   
\p
\v 15 Hichejou chun, Rahab in jong, amani chu khao khat in bangkot a kon chun agah khailhan ahi. Ajeh chu Rahab in chu hiche khopi kulpi pal'a kingam ahi.  
\v 16 Amanun ajah lhonnah, “Molchung langa kaltou lhon'in, ajole minungdel ho chun nahin tohkha get unte, hiche achun nithum hung um lhon'in minungdel ho chu ahung kile kahsen kisel lhon'in, chujou tengleh nachena nom lhonnah chelhon tan,” ati.   
\p
\v 17 Apotdoh masang lhon'in, amanin amanu kom'a chun, “Nanghon na kiseipeh u dungjuiya hi nahung chon uleh keiho jong kakitep nau banga hi kahin toh diu ahi atilhon'e  
\v 18 Keiho hi hiche gam'a hi kahung tengu leh nangin hiche khaosan hi keini nei khailhah lhonna hiche bangkot a konna hi nana khailhah ding ahi. Chujou teng, na insung mite jouse, napa, nang, nasopiho jouse le na insung mite jouse na insung uva hi na-na um diu ahi.  
\v 19 Ijemtia napotdoh uva lamlen dunga na-na chekhah uva nathi khah uva ahileh keiho thepmo hilou ding ahi. Amavang hiche insunga hi naum uva khat touvin na suhkhah uleh hitobanga thina nato uleh keiho mopohna hi ding ahi.  
\v 20 Ahinlah nang hon nei joulhep uva ahivang leh hiche kihahselna hi panna bei hi ding ahi,” atipeh lhon'e.   
\p
\v 21 Amanun “Nasei lhon chu kapom'e,” ati. Hiti chun amani chu asoldoh in, khaosan chu bangkot achun akhai tan ahi.   
\p
\v 22 Gam velhi teni chu thinglhang gam langah akaltou lhon'in nithum aga chaam lhon'in ahi. Amani nungdel ho chun lamlen lang chu muntin aga phetleng jengun ahinlah ajona in lolhing louvin ahung kile tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 23 Hichun gam velhi teni chu thinglhang gam'a kon'in ahung kumsuh lhon'in Jordan vadung ahin pal galkai lhon'in Joshua kom'a chun thilsoh jouse chu alhut lhon tan ahi.  
\v 24 “Pakaijin gam jouse hi eipe tauve, ajeh chu agam mite ho jouse khu eiho kichatnan atija gam tauve,” ati lhon'e.   
\c 3  
\s1 Israel te Jordan Agalkai U  
\p
\v 1 Joshua chu Israel te jouse toh jingpitah in Shittim ahin dalhauvin Jordan vadung pang chu ahung lhungun, galkaipai louvin hilai mun achun ngahmun akisem tauvin ahi.  
\v 2 Hiti chun nithum jouvin Israel lamkaiho chu ngahmun achun acheuvin,  
\v 3 mipiho chu thupeh aganeijun: “Nanghon Pakai na Pathen'u Kitepna Thingkhong khu Levi thempu hon ahinput u namu tengu leh naum nau mun cheh uva kon'in kipat unlang anungu juiyun.  
\v 4 Nangho hiche lampia hi na-na chekhah lou jeh un ama hon napui diu ahi. Nangho le amaho kikah chu tong sangni hi ding hiche kalval'a hi na chenai louhel diu ahi,” atiuve.   
\p
\v 5 Hichun Joshua’n mipi ho kom'a chun “Nangho le nangho kisuthengun, ajeh chu jing nikho leh Pakaijin nangho lah a thil kidang abol ding ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 6 Jingkah in, Joshua'n thempuho kom'a chun aseijin, “Kitepna Thingkhong chu pu-uvin lang mipi ho masang langa chun cheuvin,” ati. Hichun amaho akipatdoh un, Kitepna Thingkhong chu apu uvin mipi ho masanga chun acheuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Pakaijin Joshua kom'a chun, “Tuni hin keiman nangma hi Israel mite jouse mitmua katunlet ding nahi, chutengleh ama hon Mose kana umpi bang banga nangjong kaumpi hi ahetdoh thei diu ahi.  
\v 8 Kitepna Thingkhong pua thempuho kom'a chun hiche thupeh hi seipeh in: 'Nangho Jordan vadung pang nalhun tengu leh Jordan vadung chu chonlut un lang ding denun,'” ati.   
\p
\v 9 Hiti chun Joshua’n jong Israel te jah a chun “Hungun lang Pakai na Pathen uvin ipi na jahsah nom uvem hung ngaijun.  
\v 10 Tunia hi nang hon hingjing Pathen chu nalah uva aum'e ti nahet diu ahi. Aman Canaan mite, Hit mite, Hivi mite, Periz mite, Girgas mite, Amor mite chule Jebus mite jouse namasang uva na nomang peh diu ahi.  
\v 11 Ven, vannoi leiset pumpi Pakai Kitepna Thingkhong chun nangho hiche Jordan vadunga hi napui galkai diu ahi!  
\v 12 Tun, Israel phung som le ni lah a kon chun phungkhat a mikhat cheh lhengdoh in.  
\v 13 Vannoi leiset pumpi Pakai, Pakai Thingkhong chu thempu hon aput diu ahi. Akengun twi agah chotkhah khah uleh, sah langa konna twi hung long chu tan jeng ding, chuleh vadung chu banglai banga kikhang jeng ding ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 14 Hiti chun mipi ho chun angahmun uchu ahin dalhauvin Jordan palgalkai ding chun ahung kijot tauve, chuleh Kitepna Thingkhong pua thempu ho chu ahung masauvin ahi.  
\v 15 Hichu chang-at phatlai ahijeh in Jordan chu akam'a twi letjenga ahi. Ahinla thingkong pua thempuho keng chun vadung geichin twilah chu agah chotkhah phatnun,  
\v 16 sah langa konna hunglong twi chu akitingtan jengin Adam kiti Zerethen kom'a khopi gei chun gamla tah geijin twi alom changing akikhanghel jengin ahi. Chuleh hiche noilanga twi ho chu alon kanghel tokah in Dead Sea ah alonglutnin ahi. Hijeh chun mipi ho chu Jericho khopi kom'a chun agalkaijun ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Hiti chun mipi ho akijot sungu chun Pakai Thingkhong pu thempuho chu vadung kim tolgolaiya chun ading denun ahi. Ama hon Israel nam pumpi chu Jordan tolgolai ajot galkai soh tokah uvin angah un ahi.   
\c 4  
\s1 Melchihna Song Kiphut  
\p
\v 1 Mipiho chu Jordan agalkai sohhel phatnun, Pakaijin Joshua kom'a chun thu ahin seije,  
\v 2 “Tun phungtin'a kon'in pasal som le ni lhengdoh inlang,  
\v 3 Jordan vadung lailung nadin nauva kon'in song som le ni hin choidoh un, hichu choijun lang tunilhah a nagena diu mun achun sekhom'un,” ati.  
\v 4 Hiti chun Joshua’n Israel phungtin'a konna alhendoh som le ni ho chu akou khom’in ahi.  
\v 5 Amaho kom'a chun, “Jordan lailung Pakai na Pathen'u thingkong masanga khun cheuvin lang mikhat in songkhat cheh na lengkou uvah hinpu uvin lang, Israel phung som le ni a kon'in phungkhat a song khat cheh, song som le ni chu hin choijun tin aseipeh in ahi.  
\v 6 Eihon hiche song ho hi melchihna khat a iman diu ahi. Khonung tengleh nacha teuvin hiche song hi ipi vetsahna ham tia ahindoh tengu leh,  
\v 7 nanghon hitia hi nadonbut diu ahi, 'Pakai Kitepna Thingkhong chu akiput galkai phat chun Jordan vadung chu atanghel jengtan ahi,' Israel mipi ten itih chan hijongleh ahetjingna diuva hiche songho hi amelchihna hi ding ahi tia na seipeh diu ahi.” ati.   
\p
\v 8 Hiti chun mipi hon Joshua athupeh bang bangin abol’un ahi. Pakaijin Joshua ana thupeh bang bangin Jordan vadung lailunga kon chun phung khat a songkhat cheh toh kitoh dingin song chu som le ni ahinpu uvin ahi. Ama hon hichu ajan genau ngahmun'ah apolut u hetjingna song dingin aphut tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Joshua’n jong achombeh in Jordan lailunga Kitepna Thingkhong puho keng phangin achotpha nau laitah a chun song som le ni aphutnin ahi. Hiche chu tuni geijin aum nalaijin ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Mose’n Pakai thupeh ho Joshua ana pehson ho chu akitoldoh sohkei tokah in thingkong pua thempuho chu vadung lailunga chun ading jingun ahi. Alangkhatnah, mipi ho chu kinotah in vadung chu agalkaijun ahi.  
\v 11 Mipiho jouse chu bitkeija agalkai sohkei phatnun Pakai Thingkhong puho jong chu mipi ho mitmu changtah chun agalkaijun ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Gal manchah kichoi Reuben leh Gad phungmi ho leh Manasseh phung akehkhatnin Mose thupeh bangin Israel te chu alamkaijun Jordan agalkai masauvin ahi.  
\v 13 Hitobanga gal manchah kichoi mihem sangsomli ho chu galsat dinga kigosadem ahiuve, chuleh, amaho chu Pakai mapuina chang pum'in Jericho khopi phaicham lang’ah chun agalkai tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Hiche nikho chun Pakaijin Joshua chu Israel te jouse mitmun atunglen in ahi, hiti chun ama hon ahinkho lhumkei uvin agingun, Mose anaja bang bangun jana ana peuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Pakaijin Joshua kom'a chun hitin ana seije,  
\v 16 “Vadung tolgo laiya kon chun Pakai Kitepna Thingkhong puho chu hungdoh dingin thu pen,” ati.  
\v 17 Hiti chun Joshua’n jong thupeh chu aneitan ahi.  
\v 18 Pakai Kitepna Thingkhongpu thempuho chu vadung golaija konna ahung potdoh uva akengphangun vadung pang tolgo lah chu ahinchot phat uvin Jordan vadung twi chu ahunglong kitnin tumasanga bang bangin vadung pang aletdoh sohkei kittan ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Mipi chu lhamasapen nisom channi chun Jordan chu ahung galkaijun Jericho solam Gilgal munna chun ngahmun asem'un ahi.  
\v 20 Joshua’n Jordan vadunga konna song som le ni ahinlah chu hiche Gilgal mun a hin alom changin asekhomin ahi.   
\p
\v 21 Hichun Joshua’n Israel te kom'a chun aseijin, “Khonung leh nacha teuvin hiche hi ipi vetsahna ham tia nahindoh tengu leh,  
\v 22 Hiteng chuleh nang hon 'Hiche laiya hi Israel chate Jordan tolgo laiya ahung galkaina mun u chu ahi,' tia na donbut diu ahi,  
\v 23 Ajeh chu, na Pakai na Pathen uvin nangho mitmu tah a twi chu akansah a hitia chu twikhanglen San eigalkai sah kahseuva akansah banga chu igalkai sohkei tokah uva akansah ahi.  
\v 24 Leiset chunga nam jousen Pakai ban thahat anasatje ahetsohna diu leh nang hon jong Pakai na Pathen'u itih chan hijongleh nagin jing theina diu ahi tia na seipeh diu ahi.” tin aseipeh tai.   
\c 5  
\p
\v 1 Jordan lhumlam'a cheng Amor mite lengho leh Mediterranean panga cheng Canaan mite leng hon Israel mipite hi a Pathen uvin Jordan vadung asuhkhang peh in ahin palgalkai sahtai ti ajahdoh phatnun kichatnan alungthim'u alhulhop gam tauvin ahi.   
\s1 Gilgal Mun a Chep Kitan  
\p
\v 2 Hiche pettah chun Pakaijin Joshua kom'ah “Songhem chu chemcha bangin sem inlang Israel te chu akhangni chanin achep u tanpeh in,” ati.  
\v 3 Hiti chun Joshua’n jong songhem chemcha in asemin Israel te chu Gibeath-haaraloth mun'ah achep u ana tanpeh in ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Joshua’n amaho chu achep u atanpeh louva khoh a ahi, ajeh chu Egypt ahin dalhah uva galsat thei pasal ho jouse chu gamthip gam'a ana thigam ahi tauve. \x + \xo 5:4 \xt Minbu 14:28-35\x*  
\v 5 Egypt hin dalha a pasal ho jouse chu achep u ana kitan sohkeija ahiuvin, ahinlah Egypt a konna ahung potdoh uva gamthip noija ahung kholjin nau kum sunga pengho chu achep u kitan loulai ngen ahiuve.  
\v 6 Israel ten Egypt ahin dalhah uva galsat thei jouse athigam kahseuva kum somli sung hi gamthip noija hung kholjin ahiuve. Ajeh chu ama hon Pakai thupeh anitlou jeh un Pakaijin khoiju le bongnoi lonna gam peh dinga ateppeh nau gam chu alutsah louna dinga ana kihahsel'a ahi.  
\v 7 Hijeh chun Joshua’n apateu mun lothei dinga hung kikhanlhit ho chu achep u atanpeh u ahi. Ajeh chu amaho hin Gamtep Gam ahinjot nauva hi achep u ana kitan khaloulai ngen ahiuve.  
\v 8 Pasal jouse achep u akitan jeh chun amaho adamdoh kahsen ngahmun a chun ana kicholdo tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Hichun Pakaijin Joshua kom'a chun “Tunia hi Egypt gam'a na sohchan nauva najum nau chu katolmangpeh u ahitai,” ati. Hijeh a chu hiche mun chu tuni chan geija Gilgal kitia ahitai.   
\p
\v 10 Israel ten Gilgal mun a ngahmun asem sungu lhamasa nisom le nili chan nilhah chun Jericho phaicham a Kalchuh Kut ana mangun ahi. \x + \xo 5:10 \xt Potdohbu 12:1-13\x*  
\v 11 Hiche jou ajing nikho tah chun agamsung soh agamga cholsolou changlhah a kisem leh anchang kikang chu anepan tauvin ahi.  
\v 12 Ama hon agamsung soh agamga aneh masat ni uva pat chun Manna akimu tapon, mu jong akimukit mong-mong tapon ahi. \x + \xo 5:12 \xt Potdohbu 16:35\x*   
\s1 Pakai Sepai Jalamkai pan Joshua Akimaitopi  
\p
\v 13 Joshua chu Jericho khopi kom aga lhun chun akhodah in chunglang avetleh akhut a chemjam kichoi mikhat amasanga adin chu amun ahi. Joshua chun ajonlutnin amapa chu ana dongin, “Nang hi eipanpi ding kagol nahim ahilouleh galmi nahim? ati.   
\p
\v 14 Ama chun ahin donbut in “Khatcha chu kahipoi, keima Pakai sepai te lamkaija pang tua hi hungkon kahitai,” ati. Hichun Joshua chu tolla abohkhup in achibaijin, “Ka Pakaijin na lhacha keima hi ipi nei bolsah got ham?” ati.  
\v 15 Pakai sepai te lamkai pa chun adonbutnin, “Na kengkoh chu sutlhan ajeh chu na dinna chu muntheng ahi,” ati. Hichun akiseipeh bang chun Joshua’n aboltai.   
\c 6  
\s1 Jericho Khopi Kisuhchim  
\p
\v 1 Tun Jericho mipite chun Israel te chu akichat jeh un akhopiu kelkot chu akam chahkheh jengun ahi. Mi koimacha avadohsah pouvin lut jong alutsah pouvin ahi.  
\v 2 Ahinlah Pakaijin Joshua kom'ah, “Hiche khopi leh alengpau chuleh asepai teu jouse jong nakhut a ka pehdoh ahitai.  
\v 3 Nang leh na sepai chengse toh nigup sunga hi niseh leh khopi hi khatvei navel diu ahi.  
\v 4 Thingkhong masanga hi thempu sagi in kelchalki khat cheh akichoi uva kijot diu ahi. Nisagi channi leh nang hon hiche khopi hi sagivei navel diu ahi.  
\v 5 Thempu hon kelchalki ho chu ahin mut-mut uleh mipi ten na onei chasun sun uva sangtah a nasap diu ahi. Hiteng chuleh khopi kulpi chu chimlha ding, hiteng chuleh mipi ho chu khopi sunga chu na lhailut uva na delkhum jeng diu ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 6 Hiti chun Joshua in thempuho chu akoukhom'in hiti hin aseipeh tai, “Pakai Kitepna Thingkhong chu pu uvinlang, thempu sagi chun kelchalki kichoi cheh unlang mipi masanga khun kijotnun” ati.  
\v 7 Hijou chun aman mipi ho chu thu apen, “Khopi vella chun kijotnun, gal manchah kichoi chengse chu Pakai Thingkhong masanga cheuhen lang mipi chu lamkai uhen,” ati.  
\v 8 Joshua’n mipi ho kom'a thu ana seijou chun Thempu sagiho chun pengkul akichoi cheh un Pakai masanga chun akijotnun pengkul ho chu amutnun ahi. Chuleh Pakai Kitepna Thingkhong chu ajuijun ahi.  
\v 9 Gal manchah kichoi phabep chu pengkul kichoi thempuho masanga akijotnun, loikhat chu thingkong nung langa akijotnun, thempuho chun pengkul chu amutjom jingun ahi.  
\v 10 Joshua’n thu ahinpen, “Koima chan kholhang sam hih un, pao jong paopoh hih un, keiman sam'un kati tokah in thu chengkhat cha jong nakam uva kon'in gindohsah hih un,” ati.  
\v 11 Hiti chun Pakai Thingkhong chu apu uvin hiche nikho chun khatvei khopi chu avellun, chujouvin abonchauvin ngahmun chu ajonun aga geh un ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Ajingin Joshua chu jingkah matah in akipatdoh in ahileh thempuho jong chun Pakai Thingkhong chu apukitnun ahi.  
\v 13 Thempu sagi ho chun pengkul chu akichoi cheh un Pakai Thingkhong masanga chun akijotnun, pengkul chu amutnun ahi. Avellin, gal manchah kichoi ho chu pengkul kichoi thempu ho masang leh Pakai Thingkhong puho nung’ah akijotnun ahi. Hiche sungse hin thempuho chun pengkul chu amut-mut jengun ahi.  
\v 14 Anini channa in jong ama hon khopi chu avelkitnun chujouvin ngahmun a ahung kile kitnun ahi. Hitobang hin nigup sungse chun abollun ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Nisagi channa in Israel te chu khovah lhah in akipatdoh un tumasanga abol bang bangun khopi chu avel kitnun ahi. Ahin tuchunga hin khopi chu sagivei avellun ahi.  
\v 16 Sagivei avel jouvun thempu hon pengkul thongjen jun'a ahin mutphat uchun Joshua’n mipi ho chu thu ahinpen, “Kholhang sam'un! Pakaijin hiche khopi hi nepeh u ahitai!  
\v 17 Jericho khopi leh asunga um jouse hi Pakaijin asuhmang sohkei ding ahitai: Rahab kijohnu leh a insung mite jouse chu kihinghoi ding ahi, ajeh chu amanun gamvelhi a kisol ho chu ana hoidoh sah in ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Suhmang dinga um thil ho chu khatcha suloh hihbeh un, achutilouleh nangho jong na kisuhmang tha dingu ahi, chuleh Israel ngahmun'a hi hamsetna nahin lhutkhumlo diu ahi.  
\v 19 Amavang dangka le sana, chule thih le sum-eng’a kisem thil ho chu Pakaiya atheng ahin hiche ho chu Pakai sumkholna a lut ding ahi,” tin thupeh ana neitai.   
\p
\v 20 Mipiho chun pengkul kimut gin chu ajah phatnun a onei chasunun asamun ahileh Jericho kulpi chu achimlha jengin ahi. Hiche phat chun Israel ten khopi sung chu anokhum'un ala tauve. \x + \xo 6:20 \xt Heb 11:30\x*  
\v 21 Ama hon khopi sunga umho jouse, numei pasal, ateh akhang, bong, kelngoi, kelcha chuleh sangan abonchan asumang sohkeiyun ahi.   
\p
\v 22 Hichun Joshua’n gam velhia che teni kom'a chun, nakitepna lhon dungjuijin akijohnu in achun lut lhon'in lang amanu le a insung mite jouse chu gapuidoh lhon'in ati.   
\p
\v 23 Gamvelhia che teni chu achelut lhon'in Rahab chu ama toh umkhom apa le anu, asopiho le a insung mite jouse chutoh aga puidoh lhon'in ahi.   
\p
\v 24 Hijou chun, Israel ten khopi chu asunga um jouse toh ahallhauvin asumanghel tauvin ahi. Ahin sum le sana, chule sum-eng le thih a kisem thil ho vang chu Pakai sumkholna mun'ah akoijun ahi.  
\v 25 Hiti chun Joshua’n Rahab kijohnu chu insunga aum khompi a insung mite jouse toh ahuhdoh in ahi, ajeh chu aman Jericho velhi dinga asol teni chu ana seldoh a ana hoidoh sah lhon ahi. \x + \xo 6:25 \xt Heb 11:31\x*   
\p
\v 26 Hichun, Joshua’n Jericho khopi chu ana gaosap in:  
\b  
\q1 “Koi hileh hiche Jericho khopi sapha go chan chu  
\q2 Pakai sapset changhen,  
\q1 Abul tungdohgo a chu,  
\q2 achapa masapen loulo hen,  
\q1 akelkot tungdohgo achun,  
\q2 achapa lhumpen chaanlo hen,” ati. \x + \xo 6:26 \xt 1 Lgt 16:34\x*   
\b  
\p
\v 27 Hiti chun Pakaijin Joshua chu ana umpin hijeh chun gamsung pumpia chun amin ana kithang lheh jeng tan ahi.   
\c 7  
\s1 Israel ten Ai Khopi Alel’u  
\p
\v 1 Ahinla Israel’in sapset changsa thil ho chunga hin thupeh ana palkeh un ahi. Achan kitipa hin sapset changsa thil ho phabep chu ana gudoh tan, hijeh chun Pakai chu Israel chungah ana lunghang lheh jengin ahi. Achan kitipa hi, Judah phung sunga Zerah chapa Zimri chilhah a kon Carmi chapa ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Joshua’n Jericho a kon'in, Beth-aven kom, Bethel solam a um Ai khopi velhi dingin mi phabep asol in ahi.  
\v 3 Amaho ahung kile phatnun Joshua kom'a chun hitin aseijun ahi, “Eiho ibon uva ichetouvu angaipoi ajeh chu hiche Ai khopi nokhum ding khun mi sangni ahilouleh sangthum kal ngai ponte atiuvin ahi. Amaho khu lhomcha bou ahiuvin eiho iboncha uva ichetou khoh u angaipoi atiuve.”   
\p
\v 4 Hijeh chun mi 3,000 tobang asol'un ahileh gimneitah in gal ahinlal tauvin ahi.  
\v 5 Ai khomi ten Israel ho chu akhopiu kelkotna kon'in Sheberim geijin ahin dellutnun lamsah lamma nungjam ho chu mi somthum le gup tobang athatnun ahi. Hitobang thilsoh a kon hin Israel te chu kichatnan adim tauvin alungu adai lheh jeng tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Joshua leh Israel upate jouse lunghemin aponsil u abot-eh jengun, aluchang uvah leivui akinu uvin Pakai Thingkhong maija chun tolla abohkhup un nilhah lang geijin akisehgim jengun ahi.  
\v 7 Hichun Joshua akapjah jengin, “O thanei tah Pakai, hiche Amor mite thagam ding bepma hi ipi dinga hiche Jordan hi neihin pui galkaiju ham? Hiti ding sanga hi Jordan gallang khatna chu nei chenden sah jengu leh iti aham?  
\v 8 Pakai, Israel hi agal mitea konna hi ajam thei bepma ahileh ipi kasei thei ding ham?  
\v 9 Ajeh chu, Canaan mite le hiche gamsunga cheng mite ho hin hiche hi ajahdoh phat uleh, ama hon eihin umkimvel’un tin hiche gam leisetna konna hi eisuhmang tah lou diu ham? Chutengleh amin loupi jaangaina hi iti ding hitam?” ati.   
\p
\v 10 Ahinlah Pakaijin Joshua kom'ah ahin seijin, “Kithoudoh loijin, ipi dinga bohkhupma kijam jeng nahi ham?  
\v 11 Israel’in kakitepna asukeh in sapset changsa thil ho agu uvin, eijoulhepmun athilkeo lah uva akoijun ahi.  
\v 12 Hiche jeh a hi Israel te agalteu masanga dingjou louva gallel’a jam'a ahiuve. Tua hi Israel te amaho jeng jong hi suhmang dinga uma ahi tauve. Nalah uva um sapset changsa thilkeo ho chu na suhmang lou uleh keiman nangho kaumpi louding nahiuve.   
\p
\v 13 Thoudoh inlang, jing nikho kigotna dingin namite hi amaho le amaho kisuhthengsah in. Ajeh chu, Pakai Israel Pathen'in aseije, O Israel, sapset changsa thilkeo ho chu nalah uva akiselden nalaije, hiche ho hi nahin lahdoh tokah uva gal masanga nadin joulou diu ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Jingkah tengleh naphung dungjui uva nahung kigol diu ahi, hiteng chuleh Pakaijin achonsepa chu koiphung pen a kon ham ti ahin phondoh ding ahi. Pakaijin ahin lhendoh phung chu aphungkhaija nahung kigoldoh diu, Pakaijin achonse phungkhai chu ahin lhendoh ding ahi. Pakaijin ahin lhendoh phungkhai chu hung kigol diu achonse insung chu ahin lhendoh ding ahi. Ajonapen’a chu achonse insung mite chu khat-khatna hung kigoldoh diu ahi.  
\v 15 Koi hileh hiche sapset chang thil ana gupen pen ama tah chu anei jouse toh halvam tha ding ahi, ajeh chu aman Pakai kitepna chu apalkeh a Israel chunga hitobang hamsetna chu achuh sah ahi,” ati.   
\s1 Achan Chonsetna  
\p
\v 16 Joshua’n jong jingkah matah in athouvin Israel phungho chu Pakai maijah ahin goldoh in ahileh Judah phung chu matdoh ahitai.  
\v 17 Hijeh chun Judah phungkhai chu ahung kigoldoh in ahileh Zerah phungkhai chu akimandoh kittan ahi. Hichejou chun Zerah insungmi chu ahung kigoldoh un ahileh Zimri insung chu matdoh ahitai.  
\v 18 Zimri insung mite jouse chu ama chang cheh in ahung kigoldoh un ahileh Achan chu ahin mandoh tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Hichun Joshua’n Achan kom'a chun hitin aseije, “Kachapa, Israel Pathen loupina hi jana penlang thudihtah seijin, ipi bepseu na-na bol hitam phongdoh inlang, nei seipeh in, imacha im hihbeh in” ati.   
\p
\v 20 Achan’in adonbutnin, “Adih’e, Pakai dounan kana chonsetai.  
\v 21 Thil kichomdoh lah a chun, Babylon pon hoitah khattoh, dangka shekel 200 toh, shekel sangnga gih sana lhonkhat toh kamun ahileh ka deichan kana kilah tai. Hiche ho chu ka ponbuh sungah dangka chutoh tolla kavuijin ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 22 Hichun Joshua’n akholtoh dingin mi phabep asol'in, amaho acheuvin ahileh Achan'in asei bang chun thil kiguho chu dangka chutoh akivuitha chu agamu uvin ahi.  
\v 23 Ama hon ponbuh a kon chun hiche thil ho jouse chu ahin choijun Israel te leh Joshua kom'a chun ahin choijun, hiche ho chu Pakai angsung tollhanga chun asekhom'un ahi.   
\p
\v 24 Hichun Israel te leh Joshua’n Achan toh, dangka leh ponloupi, sana lhon toh, achapa te le achanu te, abongchal ho, asangan ho, akelngoiho le akeltah ho, aponbuh leh athil ho jouse chu Achor phaicham'ah ahin polutnun ahi.  
\v 25 Hichun Joshua’n Achan jah a chun, “Ipi dinga nangin ilah uva hitobang hamsetna hi nahin pohlut ham?” ati. Hichun Israel te jousen Achan leh a insung mite chu song’in aseplih un atahsa long’u meiyin ahalvam tauve.  
\v 26 Achan chunga chun songlom aseuvin tuni chan geijin aum jing nalaije. Hijeh chun hiche mun chu hichenia pat chun Lungkhamna Phaicham akisah tan ahi. Hiche pet chun Pakai lunghanna chu adailha tai.   
\c 8  
\s1 Israel ten Ai Khopi Ajo U  
\p
\v 1 Hiche jou chun Pakaijin Joshua kom'a chun aseije, “Kicha hih’in, lungthoina jong neihih in, na sepai ho chu puijin lang Ai khopi khu gadelkhum tan, ajeh chu Ai lengpa le amipi te, akhopi le agam chu nangma khutna kapehdoh ahitai.  
\v 2 Jericho le alengpau na suhgam banga amaho jong na suhgam ding, amavang tuchunga hi agancha hou leh anei agou na chomdoh hou chu nakilah theiju ahi. Akhopiu nung langa khun gachangpang tauvin,” ati.   
\p
\v 3 Hiti chun Joshua leh asepai te chu Ai khopi gadelkhum dingin akon touvun ahi. Joshua’n asepai te lah a galsat hat cheh 30,000 alhengdoh in janin asoldoh in,  
\v 4 hiti hin thupeh aneijin ahi: “Nangho cheuvin lang khopi nung langa khun kinaichan gachangpang unlang khopi delkhum ding khun kigosademin umun.  
\v 5 Hiteng chuleh kei le kaloiho chengin khopi chu ka dellut diu chutengleh amasa-a bang-bang chun amaho keiho satdin hung kondoh un tin chutengleh amaho masanga chu keiho kajam diu ahi.  
\v 6 Khopia konna chu keihon amaho chu ka kidelmang sah diu, chutengleh ama hon Israel te hi amasa bang-banga imasang uva jamkitna ahi tauve ati diu ahi. Chujou teng chuleh keiho amahoa konna kajam sung uva chu,  
\v 7 nangho na changpan nauva kon chun hung potdoh unlang akhopiu chu nalonvuh jeng diu ahi, na Pakai na Pathen uvin nangho khutna nahin pehdoh diu ahi.  
\v 8 Chutengleh Pakaijin na thupeh bang bangun akhopiu chu meiyin hallha jengun hichu thupeh ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 9 Hiti chun amaho akipatdoh un Bethel leh Ai khopi lhumlam kikah achangpanna diu munah chun ache tauvin ahi. Ahinlah Joshua chu hiche jou chun mipi ho toh ngahmun a chun agehkhomun ahi.  
\v 10 Joshua chu jingkah langin matah in akipatnin amite asuthouvin Ai khopi lang ajontan, hichea hin Israel upahon ana juijun ahi.  
\v 11 Joshua chu ama toh umkhom sepaiho cheng chutoh khopi maija chun akijotnun sahlanga chun ngahmun asemun ahi. Amaho leh Ai kikah a chun phaicham khat aumin ahi.  
\v 12 Chuin aman mi 5,000 tobang apuijin Bethel leh Ai khopi kikah khopi lhumlam'a chun achangpan sah in ahi.  
\v 13 Hiti chun asepai bulpi pen chu khopi sah langa apansah in chuleh khopi lhumlam'a chun changpang loi akoiyin, Joshua ama tah chu phaicham'a chun ageh in ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Ai lengpan phaicham langa um Israel te chu agahmu phatnin ama le asepai te jouse chun jingpitah in Jordan phaicham gah kigalmuna mun a chun anokhum tauvin ahi. Ahinla khopi nunglanga chun amaho aguh a changpanga aume tichu aman ahetlou ahi.  
\v 15 Joshua leh Israel sepai te chu gallel tobangin gammang langa chun ajam tauvin ahi.  
\v 16 Hiche chun khopi sunga um jouse chu akikoudoh un abonchauvin amaho chu adel tauvin, hiti chun amaho chu khopia kon chun alhemdoh tauvin ahi.  
\v 17 Ai ahilouleh Bethel'a chun mi khatcha kidalha louvin Israel te chu adel sohkei tauvin ahi. Hiti chun khopi ahom keuvin adalha tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Hiche jou chun Pakaijin Joshua kom'a chun hitin ahin seije, “Na tengchau chu domsang unlang Ai khopi lang ngatsah tauvin, ajeh chu keiman hiche khu nangho khutna ka pehdoh ahitai” ati. Hichun Joshua’n akhutna um atengcha chu adomsang’in khopi lang chu agah ngatsah tan ahi.  
\v 19 Joshua’n akhut adopsang phatnin changpang ho jouse chu akisel nauva kon'in ahung potdoh un khopi langa chun alonglut jeng tauvin ahi. Ama hon gangtah in khopi chu alouvin meiyin ahallha tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 20 Ai khomite chu akinung heijun agah veuvin ahileh, khopia konna meikhu chu vanlaijol langa akitung jengin ahileh chena ding helouvin abeiden tauvin ahi. Ajeh chu Israel te gammang langa ana jamlut ho chu ahung kileheijun amaho chu ahin nungdel tauvin ahi.  
\v 21 Joshua leh Israel te chun apanlah nau chu alolhing’in khopia kon chun meikhu akitungdoh tai tichu amu phatnun ahung kileheijun Ai mite chu ahin delkhum tauvin ahi.  
\v 22 Alangkhat ah khopi sunga um Israel te chu ahung potdoh un galmi ho chu anunglang uva konin ahin delkhum uvin, hiti chun Ai khopi mite chu ajet avei uva Israel ten aum chinto tauvin amaho alailunga chatmo hellin aum tauve. Israel ten adelkhum'un mi khat jong asohcha ahilouleh ahingdoh a aum pouve.  
\v 23 Ai lengpa changseh chu ahingin amanun Joshua kom'ah ahin puilutnun ahi.   
\p
\v 24 Israel sepai ten Ai mite chu adel uva tollhanga um jouse chu athajou phatnun amaho akinung heijun asung langa um jouse jong chu athat chaihel tauvin ahi.  
\v 25 Hiti chun Ai khopi sunga cheng mipite jouse, numei ti pasal ti abonchan hiche nikho chun athat gamsoh hellun ahileh mi 12,000 alhingin ahi.  
\v 26 Ai khopi sunga cheng jouse chu akisuhmanghel kahsen Joshua’n atengcha chu adomsang jing jengin ahi.  
\v 27 Pakaijin Joshua athupeh bangin, khopi sunga um agancha hou leh anei agou hou chu sumang louvin Israel ten amaho chan dingin akichom tauve.  
\v 28 Hiti chun Joshua’n Ai khopi chu ahallha tan ahileh hichu tuni chan geijin amangthah paitan ahi.   
\p
\v 29 Joshua’n Ai lengpa chu nilhah lang geijin thing chungah ana khaijin, ni ahunglhum phatnin Joshua thupeh dungjuijin atahsa chu thing chunga kon'in ala lha uvin, khopi kelkot maija chun ana seplha uvin ahi. Ama hon achunga chun song asetkhum'un tuni chan geijin mutheijin aum nalaije.   
\s1 Pakai Kitepna Kithah Suhhing  
\p
\v 30 Hijou chun Joshua’n Ebal mol chungah Pakai Israel Pathen kom'ah maicham asemin, \x + \xo 8:30 \xt Danbu Ni Na 27:2-8\x*  
\v 31 Pakai lhacha Mose’in Israel chate ana thupeh Mose danbua ana kijih bangin, thihhem'a ana kikheng khalou songtum maicham chungah pumgo thilto leh chamna thilto ana bollin ahi. \x + \xo 8:31 \xt Potdohbu 20:25\x*  
\v 32 Hiti chun aman Israel te mitmu changtah chun Mose dan thupeh ho chu song chunga chun ana jihdoh in ahi.   
\p
\v 33 Hiche jou chun Israel te jouse agamsunga pengden ho ahin khopem mi ahiuvin, upaho jouse, vaihom ho jouse le thutan ho jouse ahiuvin hopnin akihomun, hopkhat chu Gerazin mol maija adingun, hopkhat chu Ebal mol maija adingun ahi. Ahopni chun aki-angngat touvin akikah uvah Pakai Kitepna Thingkhongpu Levi thempuho chu adingun ahi. Hiche hi Israel mipi ten phatthei achanna diuva Pakai lhacha Mose thupeh dungjuiya anabol jiu dungjuiya chu abol'u ahi. \x + \xo 8:33 \xt Danbu Ni Na 11:29; 27:11-14\x*   
\p
\v 34 Hiche jou chun Mose’n adan lekhabua ana jihlut phatthei bohna le sapsetna ho chu Joshua’n mipi ang'a chun asimdoh in ahi.  
\v 35 Mose thupeh thucheng ho jouse chu Israel mipi ahung kikhomho leh nunao chapangho, chuleh alah uva cheng gamdang miho pum'a ajah sohkei diuvin asimdoh soh hellin ahi.   
\c 9  
\s1 Gibeon Miten Israel Mite Ajoulhep  
\p
\v 1 Tun Jordan vadung lhumlam gam'a leng hon thilsoh ho hi aja tauvin ahi. Hite ho chu Hit mite, Amor mite, Canaan mite, Periz mite, Jebus mite lengho, lhumlam molbul'a chengho leh twikhanglen pang Lebanon mol ho chan geija chengho ahiuve.  
\v 2 Hiche lengho hin lungkhat tah a athau jekhom'a Joshua leh Israel mite hi kisatpi dingin akiloikhom'un ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Ahinlah Gibeon miten Joshua’n Jericho leh Ai abolna hi ahet phatnun,  
\v 4 amaho kihuhdohna dingun lungthim chomkhat agong tauvin ahi. Ama hon Joshua kom'a palai asol uvin, sakhao lui le asesa, jupeng lui le akibehthu ho, sangan chunga aheng’un,  
\v 5 ama hon von sesa akivonun, ponsesa akisilun, kengchot kibehthu akichotnun chuleh neh dinga akipoh u changlhah chu agopsa le amonsa ahi.  
\v 6 Amaho Gilgal a Israel te ngahmuna ahunglhun phatnun Joshua kom'a chun, “Keiho nangma toh kichamna thulhuh sem dinga kholgamla tah a konna hung kahiuve” atiuve.   
\p
\v 7 Israel ten, hiche Hivi mite ho kom'a chun adonbutnun, “Nangho hi anai vella chengmi nahi nahilouvu keihon iti kahet diu ham? Anai vella cheng nahi khah uleh keihon nangho toh kichamna thulhuh kanei theilou diu ahi” atiuve. \x + \xo 9:7 \xt Potdohbu 23:32; 34:12; Danbu Ni Na 7:2\x*   
\p
\v 8 Ama hon, “Keiho hi nasohte kahiuve” tin adonbutnun ahi. Ahin Joshua’n, “Nangho koi nahiuva, hoiya konna hung nahiu ham?”ati.   
\p
\v 9 Ama hon adonbutnun, “Nasohte hi ka chennau mun gamla tah a konna hung kahiuve. Keihon na Pakai na Pathen'u thanei dan Egypt gam'a anatoh ho kana jauvin ahi.  
\v 10 Keihon Jordan solam'a Amor leng teni leh Heshbon lengpa Sihon le Ashtaroth a um Bashan lengpa Og chunga anatoh ho kajauvin ahi. \x + \xo 9:10 \xt Minbu 21:21-35\x*  
\v 11 Hijeh chun ka upa hou le ka mipite jousen eihin thulhah un, 'Khol gamla tah jotna dingin neh le chah kipoh un, Israel mipite chu gakimupi uvin lang hiti hin seijun, “keiho nasohte kahiuve keiho toh kitepna nei neipi uvin, tin gaseijun'” atiuve.   
\p
\v 12 “Hiche ka changlhah hou hi ka in uva konna kahung kipatdoh uva chu tapkonga konna sapeh a kahinpoh u ahin tuhin agobetnin a-ap tan ahi.  
\v 13 Hiche jupengho jong hi kahin thal dim uva chu thahleh a ahin, tuhin aluijin a-ehgam tai. Chuleh kavon uleh ka kengkoh u jong hi ka lamsao jotna uva konna luigam'a ahitai” atiuve.   
\p
\v 14 Hiti chun Israel ten aneh achah u chu ana kholchil’un, ahinlah Pakai dohna ananei pouve.  
\v 15 Hiche jou chun Joshua in amaho chutoh kinoptona ana neipi in amaho chu ana hinghoi tan ahi, khopi sunga alamkai houvin jong hiche kinoptona chu kihahselnan ana sudetnun ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Hiche kitepna aneiyu nithum jouvin hiche mite ho hi akomcha uva chenga ahibouvui ti ahedoh tauvin ahi.  
\v 17 Israel te chu akholtoh dingin acheuvin nithum sungin akhopi houva chun agalhung tauve. Hiche khopiho chu Gibeon, Kephirah, Beeroth, chule Kiriath-Jearim ahiuve.  
\v 18 Ahinlah Israel ten khopiho chu anokhum tapouvin ahi, ajeh chu Israel lamkai ten, Pakai Israel Pathen min panna kitepna ana neiju ahitai.  
\p Israel mipite chu, alamkai houvin chutobang kitepna chu anabol jeh un achung uvah ana phunun ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Ahinlah alamkai houvin ana donbutnun “Eihon Pakai Israel Pathen minna kihahselna inanei nau ahitah jeh a amaho chu itohkhah theilou diu ahitai.  
\v 20 Eihon amaho chu ihinghoi diu ahitai, ajeh chu eihon ikitepnau isuhkeh uleh Pathen lunghanna ichung uva chuding ahi.  
\v 21 Amaho chu ihinghoi diu ahitai” atiuve. Hiti chun ama hon Israel lamkai ten athupeh bangun akhopi sung uva twikhai ding leh thingpo dingin amangcha tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 22 Joshua’n Gibeon miho chu akou khomin hitin aseije, “Nanghon ipi dinga nei joulhep uham? Nangho hila kalah uva chenga nahi bouvun, ipi dinga gamla tah a cheng kahiuve natiu ham?  
\v 23 Nangho hi sapset chang nahi tauvin, hijeh a chu tua pat a nangho hi ka Pathen'u in a dinga thingchom le twikhaija napan jeng diu ahitai,” atipeh in ahi.   
\p
\v 24 Ama hon adonbutnun, “Pakai na Pathen uvin Mose ana thupeh dungjuiya hiche gam hi nangho napeh uva chule agamsung mite jouse hi nathagam sohkei diu ahi ti nasohte keihon kana jauvin ahi. Hijeh chun keihon nangho hi kana kicha lheh jengun ahileh hitia hi kana bol'u ahi,” atiuve.  
\v 25 “Tun keiho hi nangho khutna um kahi tauve, hijeh chun nadei dan danin neibol tauvin,” atiuve.   
\p
\v 26 Hiti chun, Israel ten amaho atha diu chu Joshua’n ana janom tapon ahi.  
\v 27 Ahin hiche nikho chun aman Gibeon mite chu Israel mipite le Pathen'in adeina mun-mun a maicham semna ding twikhai le thingchom'in ana pansah tauvin ahi. Hiche hi tuni geija ahintoh jingu ahi.   
\c 10  
\s1 Israel in Lhanglam Sepaiho Ajo  
\p
\v 1 Jerusalem lengpa Adoni-Zedek hin Joshua’n Jericho khopi le alengpau asuhmang banga Ai leh alengpau asuhmang hel chu ajadoh tan ahi. Gibeon miten jong Israel te chu akichampi uvin amaho mi in akiheilut tauve tijong ahetan ahi.  
\v 2 Hijeh chun ama leh mipite akicha lheh jengun ahi. Ajeh chu Gibeon hi khopi lentah ahin leng khopi dang ho ahin chuleh Ai sanga jong khopi lenjo ahin, Gibeon mite jong chu galsatna hatte ahiuve tijong ajan ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Hijeh chun Jerusalem leng Adoni-Zedek chun leng dang ho akou khomin, amaho chu Hebron lengpa Hoham, Jermuth lengpa Piram, Lachish lengpa Japhia chuleh Eglon lengpa Debir ahiuve.  
\v 4 “Hungun lang Gibeon mite suhmangna din neihung kithopi uvin,” tin atemun ahi, ajeh chu “ama hon Joshua leh Israel te toh kichamna asemun ahi,” ati.  
\v 5 Hijeh chun Amor mite leng-nga ho chu galsat dingin akiloikhom tauvin ahi. Hichun ama hon asepai teu chu akhom khomun Gibeon mite chu ana nokhum tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Gibeon miten Gilgal ngahmunna um Joshua kom'a chun thulhut ding mi gangtah in asol tauvin ahi. “Nasohte hi nei donda hihbeh un, gangtah in hungun lang neihung kithopi uvin lang neihung huhdoh un, ajeh chu thinglhanga cheng Amor lengho akitho khomun eihung delkhum tauve,” atiuve.   
\p
\v 7 Joshua leh asepai te chengse leh gal-hat laise toh Gilgal adalha uvin Gibeon te kithopi dingin akon tauve.  
\v 8 Pakaijin Joshua kom'ah “Amaho khu kicha hih un, ajeh chu keiman amaho chunga khu galjona kapeh u nahi tauve. Amaho khatcha nangho masanga ding ngam louding ahiuve.” Tin aseipeh tai.   
\p
\v 9 Joshua chun Gilgal'a kon'in jan khovah in lam ajotnin Amor gal mite chu kigingman louhel'in anokhum tauvin ahi.  
\v 10 Pakaijin amaho chu atijatsah in, hiti chun Israel ten Amor mite chu Gibeon’ah atam a tam athatnun ahi. Hijou chun Israel ten galmi ho chu Beth-horon geijin adellutnun Azekah leh Makkedah lampi geijin aban thapeh un ahi.  
\v 11 Amor mite chu Beth-horon lamlen lamah anungjam peh un ahileh Pakaijin vanna kon'in gellom nasatah ajuhlhah sah in Azekah alhunkah seuvin aban thagam peh in ahi. Israel ten chem'a atha sang’un gellin atha atamjon ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Hicheni chun Pakaijin Israel te chu Amor mite chunga galjona anapen ahi. Joshua’n Israel mipite mitmu changtah in Pakai hengah ana taovin,  
\b  
\q1 “Gibeon chungah nisa dingden hen,  
\q2 chuleh lha jong Aijalon phaicham chungah dingden hen” ati.   
\b  
\p
\v 13 Hiti chun nisa leh lha chu Israel nam miten agal mite ajokah seuvin ama muncheh a adingden lhontan ahi. Hiche thilsoh hi \it Jashar Lekhabua\it* kijihlutna hilou ham? Nisa chu vanlaijol'a ana ding denin nidanga nisalhum ngai bangin ana lhumpon ahi. \x + \xo 10:13 \xt 2 Samuel 1:18\x*  
\v 14 Pakaijin amite taona ana sanna ah hitobang hi tumasang leh khonung jengin jong anaum khapon ahi. Tahbeh mongin Pakaijin hiche nikho chun Israel te dingin gal ana satpeh in ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Hiche jou chun Joshua leh Israel sepai te chu Gilgal ngahmun'ah ahung kilekit tauvin ahi.   
\s1 Israel In Lhanglam Leng Nga Ho Athau  
\p
\v 16 Gal kisat laitah chun leng nga ho chu Makeddah songkoa ana kisel'un ahi.  
\v 17 Joshua’n amaho chu ahin mudoh phatnun,  
\v 18 hiti hin thupeh ana neijin ahi, “Songkohom chu song lentah in sing’un lang lengho chu ahung potdoh louna diuvin apangah chun angah ding mi koijun,” ati.  
\v 19 “Adangse chun galmi ho chu nungdel'un lang anung langa kon'in satchap jengun, akhopiu nung lhunsah kit louvin sugam jengun, ajeh chu Pakai na Pathen uvin amaho chu nangho khutna na pehdoh u ahitai,” ati.   
\p
\v 20 Joshua le Israel sepai ten galmi ho chu asuhmang soh kahseuvin athat-that jengun ahi. Hiti chun kul kigetkhum akhopi uva jamlut mi themcha khat tailou adangse chu abon chauvin asumang soh hel'un ahi.  
\v 21 Hiche jou chun, Israel te chu Joshua kom Makkedah ngahmun'ah bitkeijin akile kitnun ahi. Hiche kal chu koiman Israel te dounan thu themcha khatcha jong aseipoh ngam tapouvin ahi.  
\v 22 Hiche jou chun Joshua’n, “Songkohom kisinna songlentah chu ladoh unlang leng nga ho chu kakom'ah hin puijun” ati.  
\v 23 Hichun ama hon leng nga ho chu songko homma kon chun ahin puidoh’un, amaho chu, Jerusalem lengpa, Hebron lengpa, Jermuth lengpa, Lachish lengpa chuleh Eglon lengpa ahiuve.  
\v 24 Amaho chu ahin puidoh phatnun, Joshua’n gal lamkai ho kom'a chun, “Hungun lang na kengphang’un lengho ngongchang hi chotpha uvin” ati. Hichun ama hon asei bang chun abollun ahi.   
\p
\v 25 Joshua’n amite kom'a chun, “Kicha hih un tijatna jong neihih un, hat unlang hang’un, ajeh chu Pakaijin nagal miteu chunga hitobanga hi abol sohkei ding ahi” ati.  
\v 26 Hiche jou chun Joshua’n leng nga ho chu athat sohkeijin thingphung nga chunga chun akhai sang'in, nilhah chan geijin akhaijun ahi.   
\p
\v 27 Nisa lhum kon'in, Joshua thupeh dungjuijin lengho tahsa chu thingchunga kon'in alalhauvin ana kiselnau songkohom sunga chun aseplutnun ahi. Hijeh chun hiche songkohom chu songlentah ho asekhum'un tuni chan ngeijin aumin ahi.   
\s1 Israel Lhanglam Khopiho Asuhmang  
\p
\v 28 Hicheni ma-ma chun Joshua leh Israel ten Makkedah khopi chu alauvin asumang tauve. Aman khopi sunga um jouse chu alengpau pummin athat gam'un koimacha ahinghoi pouve. Aman amaho chu athatsoh in Jericho lengpa atha bangin Makkedah lengpa jong chu athatnin ahi.  
\v 29 Hiche jou chun, Joshua le Israel te chu acheuvin Libnah aga nokhum’un ahi.  
\v 30 Hiche jou chun, Pakaijin hiche khopi le alengpau chu amaho khutnah ana pedoh tan ahi. Aman khatcha jong hinghoi louvin athat sohkeijin ahi. Hiche jou chun Joshua’n Jericho lengpa atha bangin Libnah lengpa jong chu ana that in ahi.   
\p
\v 31 Libnah a kon'in Joshua leh Israel te chu Lachish a acheuvin agadel khum’un ahi.  
\v 32 Hichea jong hin Pakaijin Lachish chu amaho khutnah apedoh in, Joshua’n anini chanin hijong chu ajouvin Libnah abolna bang bangin athatgam sohkeijin ahi.  
\v 33 Lachish ana delkhum’u chun, Gezer lengpa Horam chu hiche khopi kithopi ding chun asepai te ahin puijin ahung lhung tan ahi. Ahinlah Joshua’n khatcha jong hinghoi louvin asepai te le amaho chu athatgam tan ahi.  
\v 34 Hijou chun Joshua le Israel sepai te chu acheuvin Eglon aga delkhum’un ahi.  
\v 35 Hicheni chun hiche khopi jong chu alauvin asunga mijouse chu athat tauve. Aman Lachish ana bolna bangin abonchauvin ana sumang sohkeijin ahi.  
\v 36 Eglon’a kon'in Joshua le Israel te Hebron geijin ache touvun aga nokhum'un ahi.  
\v 37 Ama hon hiche khopi chu alauvin amipite chu alengpau pum'in athatnun, khatcha ahinghoi pouvin ahi. Amaho vella um kho jouse jong chu hitima chun ana bollun, Eglon abolna bang bangu chun asunga um mipite jouse chu asumang sohkeijin ahi.   
\p
\v 38 Hiche jou chun Joshua le Israel te chu ahung kinung heijun Debir ahin delkhum'un ahi.  
\v 39 Akhopi chu alenpau toh avel'a kho jouse jong chu alauvin ahi. Aman khatcha hinghoi louvin abonchan ana that gam'in ahi. Aman Debir leh alengpa abolna bang le Hebron leh alengpa chuleh Libnah leh alengpa abolna bangin ana bollin ahi.   
\p
\v 40 Hiti chun Joshua’n gam pumpi chu ana joutan ahi, thinglhang gamkol sunga alenghou le amipi teu, Negev gam leh lhumlam molbul gamgi chuleh molnoisuhse ana losoh in ahi. Pakaijin ana thupeh bang bangin aman koimacha hinghoi louvin agam sunga mipi ho jouse ana sumang sohkeijin ahi.  
\v 41 Joshua’n Kadesh-barnea apat Gaza gei, Goshen khopi vel gamho le Gibeon gamgi geijin mihem ahin thatgam sohkeijin ahi.  
\v 42 Pakai Israel te Pathen chun amite dinga gal ahin satpeh jeh in khatvei pansa a agal konna ah Joshua’n hiche lengho jouse le agam hou ahin banlah sohkeijin ahi.   
\p
\v 43 Hiche jou chun Joshua le Israel te sepaiho chu Gilgal ngahmun'ah ahung kilekit tauvin ahi.   
\c 11  
\s1 Israel In Sahlam Sepaiho Ajo  
\p
\v 1 Hazor lengpa Jabin in thilsoh ho hi ajah phatnin avel'a lengho chu kouna thu athotnin, Madon lengpa Jobab, Shimron lengpa, Acshaph lengpa,  
\v 2 sahlam gamkaija lengho jouse, Galilee lhanglang Jordan phaicham gam'a lengho, Galilee molbulla lengho, lhumlam Naphoth-dor lengho,  
\v 3 Solam le lhumlam gamkaija um Canaan lengho, Amor mite lengho, Hit mite, Periz mite, thinglhang gam'a um Jebus mite, Mizpah gamsunga um Hermon molken suhlanga khopiho a um Hivi mite ho jouse chu akouvin ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Hiche lengho jouse hi galsat dingin ahungkon tauve. Amaho hi ahung kiloikhom'un asepai hou hi ahin titkhom'un ahileh alet-lha jengun ahi. Asakol hou leh akangtalai hou twikhanglen panga neldiho bangin damkom alosoh jengun ahi.  
\v 5 Hiche lengho hin athau ajekhomun Israel te sat dingin Merom kom'a twipang vellah ngahmun asem'un ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Hichun Pakaijin Joshua kom'ah hitin ahin seijin, “Amaho khu kicha hih un, jing nikho tuphat tah le hin, amaho hi athisa banga Israel te kahin pehdoh ding ahi. Hiteng chuleh asakolte akeng nasuhbai uva akangtalai hou na hallhah diu ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 7 Hiti chun Joshua leh asepai te jousen Merom kom'a twipanga chun alhailut un gangtah in adelkhum tauvin ahi.  
\v 8 Pakaijin amaho chu Israel te khutnah ahin pedoh tan, hiti chun ama hon Sidon gamlen langgei leh Misrephoth-maim chan gei chuleh Mizpah solam phaicham geipeh in ahin dellut un amaho chu khatcha hinghoi louvin ahin that sohkeiyun ahi.  
\v 9 Pakaijin aseipeh bang bangin Joshua’n asakol teu keng asatbai peh in chuleh akangtalai jouseu ahallhah peh in ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Hiche jou chun Joshua ahung kinunglen Hazor chu alan chuleh alengpau chu athatnin ahi. (Phat chomkhat a chu Hazor hi hiche lenggam ho jouse khopi anahi ahi).  
\v 11 Israel ten hiche khopi sunga mijouse abonchan asumang sohkeijin mi khatcha jong ahing hoipon ahi. Hiti chun Joshua’n khopi chu ahallha tan ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Pakai lhacha Mose’n athupeh bang bangin Joshua’n leng dang ho jouse leh amipi teu abonchan asumang sohkeijin ahi.  
\v 13 Joshua’n ana hallhah Hazor tailou Israel ten lhang chunga kitungdoh khopiho chu ana hallha pouvin ahi.  
\v 14 Israel ten khopi asuhmang houva achomdoh u nei le gou ho leh gancha ho chu akilah un ahi. Ahinla koimacha hinghoi louvin mihing jouse chu athatgam sohkeijin ahi.  
\v 15 Pathen thupeh dungjuiya Mose’n Joshua chu thu anapeh ahi. Hiti chun Joshua’n Pathen thupeh dungjuiya Mose’n ana thupeh ho jouse chu atongdoh sohkeijin ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Hiti hin Joshua’n gamsung pumpi hi ana jouvin, thinglhang gam Negev gam pumpi, Goshen khopi le avel'a gam pumpi, Molbul solam gamho, Jordan phaicham gamho, Israel molsangho leh Galilee molbul gamho jouse anala sohkeijin ahi.  
\v 17 Tun Israel gam chu Halak Mol apatnin ahung kijedoh in lhanglanga Seir chan gei aphan, chuleh sahlang gam Lebanon phaicham Hermon Mol bul'a Baal-gad chan gei ahopmin ahi. Joshua in hiche gam'a lengho jouse ana thatgam sohkeijin ahi.  
\v 18 Hiche tohmolsona dinga hin phat sottah gal ana douvun ahi.  
\v 19 Hiche gam ho a hin Gibeon a Hivi mite tailou khat chan Israel te hi ana kichampi pon ahi. Hiche Gibeon miho tailou gamdang miho jouse vang chu ana thatgam sohhel'un ahi.  
\v 20 Ajeh chu Pakaijin alungu asuhtah peh a Israel te chu ana kisatpiu ahi. Hijeh a chu amaho chu Pakaijin Mose ana thupeh bangin khotona beihel'in ana sumang’un ahi. \x + \xo 11:20 \xt Danbu Ni Na 7:16\x*   
\p
\v 21 Hiche phat sungah hin Joshua’n Hebron thinglhang gam pumpi le Debifr, Anab, Israel te le Judah gamsung pumpia cheng Anak chilhah ho jouse ana sumang sohkeiyun ahi. Aman amaho hi achennau khopiho jouse pummin anathatgam sohkeijin ahi.  
\v 22 Israel gamsung pumpia Anak chilhahho hi khatcha akihinghoi anaum pouvin ahi. Ahinlah Gaza, Gath gam'a vang amoh themkhat aum nalaijin ahi.   
\p
\v 23 Hichun Pakaijin Mose ana seipeh bang bangin Joshua’n gamsung pumpi chu anala tan ahi. Aman Israel te chu agou chan diuvin aphung aphung dungjuijin ana hoppeh in ahi. Hiti chun galsatna a kon'in gamsung chu ana kicholdo tan ahi.   
\c 12  
\s1 Mose’n Anajo Lengho  
\p
\v 1 Israel ten ana thagam uva agam'u ana lahpeh u Jordan vadung solam’a cheng lengho chu hiche ho hi ahiuve. Agam lah uchu Arnon vadunga konna Hermon Mol chan ahung kijedoh in, Jordan phaicham solam gamkaise jong ahopmin ahi. \x + \xo 12:1 \xt Minbu 21:21-35; Danbu Ni Na 2:26—3:11\x*   
\p
\v 2 Heshbon’a cheng Amor mi Sihon lengpa jong chu ana jouvun ahi, ama lenggam chu Arnon vadung geichin'a um Aroer jong ahopmin, hiche chu Arnon vadung akim'a konna Jabbok vadung gei ahin hiche hi Ammon mite gamgi melchihna chu ahitai.  
\v 3 Sihon thaneina in Jordan phaicham solam gamkai Galilee twilen sahlanga konna Chitwilen chan gei ahopmin, Beth-jeshimoth leh Pisgah lhanglang jong ahoppha'n ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Bashan Lengpa Of, Rephaim mite lah a achana chu Ashtaroth le Edrei a acheng'e.  
\v 5 Ama hin Hermon Molsang pumpi chung leh Salecah gammang toh, chuleh Bashan gamsung se-se chunga vaihom'a ana panga Geshur mite leh Maacah mite gamgi geija ana pehtha ahin, chutengleh Gilead gam kehkhat chunga jong vaihom'a, Heshbon lengpa Sihon gamgi geija vai anahom ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Pakai lhacha Mose le Israel chaten hiche leng teni hi akisatpi uvin ajou tauve, hichea hi Pakai lhacha Mose in amani gamsung pumpi chu Reuben chate leh Gad chate chuleh Manasseh phung kehkhat chenna dia anapeh ahi. \x + \xo 12:6 \xt Minbu 32:33; Danbu Ni Na 3:12\x*   
\s1 Joshua Lamkai Na A Anajo Leng Ho  
\p
\v 7 Jordan vadung gal nilhumlam Lebanon phaicham Baal-gad kiti laiya patna Seir niso lam'a hung kikhangdoh Halak Molsang geija Joshua leh Israel chaten asatgam uva Joshua’n agam jouseu Israel phung mite chenna dia ana pehdoh agamnei lengho chu hicheng hi ahiuvin,  
\v 8 agam hop mong hi thinglhang gamsung jong, phaigam jong, jong molken suhse jong, Judea gamthip sung jong, Negev gamsung jong ahin, Hit mite, Amor mite, Canaan mite Periz mite, Hivi mite chule Jebus gamsung se-se chu ahi. Hiche leng ho hi Israel in ajo ho chu ahi:   
\b  
\li1
\v 9 Jericho lengpa  
\li1 Bethel khopia kom'a Ai lengpa   
\li1
\v 10 Jerusalem lengpa  
\li1 Hebron lengpa   
\li1
\v 11 Jermuth lengpa  
\li1 Lachish lengpa   
\li1
\v 12 Eglon lengpa  
\li1 Gezer lengpa   
\li1
\v 13 Debir lengpa  
\li1 Geder lengpa   
\li1
\v 14 Hormah lengpa  
\li1 Arad lengpa   
\li1
\v 15 Libnah lengpa  
\li1 Adullam lengpa   
\li1
\v 16 Makkedah lengpa  
\li1 Bethel lengpa   
\li1
\v 17 Tappuah lengpa  
\li1 Hepher lengpa   
\li1
\v 18 Aphek lengpa  
\li1 Lasharon lengpa   
\li1
\v 19 Madon lengpa  
\li1 Hazor lengpa   
\li1
\v 20 Shimron-meron lengpa  
\li1 Acshaph lengpa   
\li1
\v 21 Taanach lengpa  
\li1 Megiddo lengpa   
\li1
\v 22 Kedesh lengpa  
\li1 Carmel a Jokneam lengpa   
\li1
\v 23 Naphot-dor gam'a Dor lengpa  
\li1 Gilgal a Goyim lengpa ahin,   
\li1
\v 24 Tirzah lengpa.  
\b  
\li1 Abon bonin, leng somthum le khat chu ana jouvin ahi.   
\c 13  
\s1 Lahbe Ding Gam Ho  
\p
\v 1 Joshua chu ateh tan, hichun Pakaijin akom'a hiti hin thu ahin seijin ahi, “Nangla nateh tan, nakum jong atam thim lheh tan ahinlah gam lahding hi atam lheh jeng nalaijin ahi.  
\v 2 Gam lahding vat nalai ho chu: Philistine te gam leh Geshur gamho sese,  
\v 3 Canaan mite gam alenjo, Egypt gamgi a Sihor vadung'a hung kipan, sahlam'a Ekron gamgi chan gei. Hichu Philistine vaipote nga ho, Gaza, Ashdod, Ashkelon, Gath, leh Ekron jong ahopmin ahi. Av mite gam  
\v 4 lhanglam gam'a ahileh Canaan mite gam pumpi ahin, chule Sidon mite gamsunga Mearah chan gei leh Aphek gei, chujongleh Amor mite gamgi chan gei ahin,  
\v 5 Gebal mite leh Lebanon gam pumpi, nisolam leng se-se, Baal-gad khopi apat Hermon molsang nisolam gei ahin, Lebo-hamath khopi jotna kotphung gei ahithai,  
\v 6 chule Lebanon apatna Misrephoth-maim chan geija mite ahiuvin, Sidon mite gam jouse hop ahi.  
\p “Mihem hijat hi aboncha keima mong mong’in Israel chate masanga kadelmang ding ahi, nangma kahil'a kathupeh bang-bang chun agam hi Israel ten alouva achenpha diuvin hoppeh pou-pou tan. \x + \xo 13:6 \xt Minbu 33:54\x*  
\v 7 Chuti ahijeh chun nangman tuhin hiche gam hi Israel phung ho leh Manasseh phung kehkhat goulo din hoppeh tan” ati.   
\s1 Jordan Luigal Nisolam Gam Kihop  
\p
\v 8 Manasseh phung kehkhat leh Reuben chate chule Gad chate chun Pakai lhacha Mose’n apehsau Jordan vadung gal nisolam gamsung chu agoulo achan diuvin akisem tauve. \x + \xo 13:8 \xt Minbu 32:33; Danbu Ni Na 3:12\x*   
\pmo
\v 9 Agam chu Arnon phaicham pamchin'a Aroer khopia pat phaicham lailunga khopi chan gei ahipeh in Medeba gam, Dibon chan gei ahi.  
\v 10 Heshbon lengvaipo Amor mite lengpa Sihon khopi jouse jong ahin Ammon mite gamgi chan gei ahi.  
\v 11 Chujongleh Gilead gam ahin, Geshur mite leh Maacah mite lhangmang geijin ahopmin Hermon Molsang pumpi jong ahin, chuleh Bashan pumpi ahop peh’in Salecah gei ahipeh’e.  
\v 12 Ashtaroth khopi le Edrei khopia lengvaipoa ana pang Bashan gamsunga Og lengpa lenggam abonchan ahopmin hiche Og kitipa hi Rephaim mite lah a achangseh a ana hingdoh mikhat jong ahi, hichengse hi Mose in gal’a akisatpia ajo sohkeija adelmang sohkei ahi.  
\v 13 Ahinlah Israel chaten Geshur mite leh Maacah mite chu tuni geijin Israel lailunga acheng cheng tauvin ahi.   
\s1 Levi Phung Mite Chan ding  
\p
\v 14 Mose in goulo ding apeh louhel phung chu Levi phung bou ahitai. Pakaijin aseipeh banga Pakai Israel Pathen henga govam thilto chengse chu Levi te chan ding agoulo diuva um'ah ahi. \x + \xo 13:14 \xt Danbu Ni Na 18:1\x*   
\s1 Reuben Phung Mite Gam Kipe  
\m
\v 15 Reuben chate phung jong chu Mose in ama-ama insung dungjui cheh in agoulo diu anapei.   
\b  
\pmo
\v 16 Hijeh chun Reuben phung mite gamgi hop chu ahileh Arnon phaicham pamchin'a kisa Aroer khopia kipan chuche phaicham lailunga khopi chan gei ahin, Medeba gam dokhang banga kikhangdoh chengse jong ahopme.  
\v 17 Heshbon khopi jong ahin dokhang banga kikhangdoh gamsunga Heshbon khopi jouse chutoh ahithai, akhopi ho chu Dibon leh Bamoth-baal, Beth-baal-meon jong ahin,  
\v 18 Jahaz jong Kedemoth jong Mephaath jong,  
\v 19 Kiriathaim jong Sibmah jong phaikola thinglhang vumma Zereth-shahar jong,  
\v 20 Beth-poer jong Pisgah lhang panglang se-se jong Beth-jeshimoth jong ahi.   
\pm
\v 21 Hicheng lah a hi dokhang langa kido gamsunga khopi jouse leh Amor mite lengpa Sihon lenggam pumpi ahithai, hiche Sihon hi Heshbon khopia lengvaipoa ana pang ahin Mose in hiche Sihon hileh Midian lamkai ho Evi, Rekem, Zur le Hur chule Reba kiti Sihon lengpa chapa te agamsunga chengse chu ana jotha ahitai.  
\v 22 Baalam kitipa Beor chapa phunsan thempa jong chu Israel chaten midang atha lah uva chu chemjamma asatlih thau ahitan ahi.  
\v 23 Hiti hin Reuben chate gamgi chu lhumlam'a Jordan vadung hi ahi jeng'e. Hiche hi Reuben chate goulo ahin, ama ama insung dungjui cheh a khopiho jong khoneo ho jong chentha cheh ahiuve.   
\s1 Gad Phung Mite Gam Kipe  
\m
\v 24 Gad phung jong chu Mose’n ama-ama insung dungjui cheh in goulo gam anapei.   
\b  
\pmo
\v 25 Chule Gad chate gamgi hopsese chu, Jazer kho ahin, Gilead gam khopi chengse ahin, Ammon mite gamsung kehkhat toh ahin, chule Rabbah nisolam'a um Aroer khopi gei ahiye.  
\v 26 Chuin Heshbon khopia pat Ramath-mizpeh le Betonim khopi gei ahin, chule Mahanaim khopia pat Lo-debar gamsung gei ahiye.  
\v 27 Chutengleh phaicham'a ahileh Beth-haram ahin, Beth-nimrah ahin, Succoth ahin, chule Zaphon le Heshbon lengpa Sihon lenggam sunga adang jouse toh ahitha’n, Jordan gamgia vadung gamgia panga Jordan vadung gallama niso lamma Galilee twilen tolam among lamtoh kimatpai ahitai.  
\v 28 Hiche hi ama ama insung dungjui cheh a akhopi jouse leh akhoneo jouse pum-pum'a kihoppeh Gad chate chan gam ahi.   
\s1 Solam’a Manasseh Phungkeh Gam Kipe  
\m
\v 29 Manasseh phung kehkhat jong chu Mose in goulo gam anapen agam goulo chu Manasseh phung kehkhat jong ama-ama insung dungjui cheh in akihom uvin ahi.   
\b  
\pmo
\v 30 Manasseh phung kehkhat gamhop lhang le molchu Mahanaim a ahung kipanin, Bashan gamsung jouse ahin adeh in Bashan gam'a Og lengpa lenggam pumpi toh Bashan gamsunga um Jair khopi jouse jong ahin, abonchan khopi somgup jen alhing’in,  
\v 31 Gilead kikah toh, Ashtaroth toh Edrei toh ahin, abon a hi Bashan gamsunga Og lengpa lenggam'a khopi jong ahiuve, hijat hi Manasseh chapa Makir chate leh Makir phung mite alangkhat kihom'a ama-ama insung dungjuiya chan kipe sohkei ahiuve.   
\b  
\p
\v 32 Gam goulo hijatpi hi Mose in Jordan vadung gal Jericho khopi nisolam Moab phaicham'a ana hopdoh ahitai.  
\v 33 Levi phung vang chu Mose in goulo gam achansah poi, ajeh chu Pakaijin ajah uva aseisa banga Pakai Israel Pathen chu Levi te goulo ahi jeng'e. \x + \xo 13:33 \xt Minbu 18:20; Danbu Ni Na 18:2\x*   
\c 14  
\s1 Jordan Luigal Lhumlam Gam Kihop  
\p
\v 1 Canaan gamsunga Eleazer thempupa leh Nun chapa Joshua chuleh apu apau, insung lhah dungjuiya Israel chate phung jousea lamkai hon Israel chate goulo dia ana hoppeh u, Israel chaten jong akisan cheh agoulo u gamsung cheh chu hicheng hi ahi.  
\v 2 Israel phungko le akeh khat gam kihop ding dol'a Pakaijin Mose thu anapeh bang bangin agoulo diu gam chan chu vang kisanga kihom anahi. \x + \xo 14:2 \xt Minbu 26:52-56; 34:13\x*  
\v 3 Israel phungni le phung kehkhat vang chu Mose in agoulo diuva Jordan vadung gallam a gam anapehsa ahitai, Levi phung mite chu Israel lah a goulo ding gam apehlou mong mong ahi. \x + \xo 14:3 \xt Minbu 32:33; 34:14,15; Danbu Ni Na 3:12-17\x*  
\v 4 Chujongleh Joseph chilhah chu phungni akisouvin, Manasseh le Ephraim ahi, Levi te vang chu gamsunga amaho chan ding gam akipepon, achenna diu khopi mai leh gancha avahna diu hamhing gamtoh athilkeo u mai-mai bou ahi.  
\v 5 Pakaijin Mose ahil'a athupeh bang bangin Israel chaten abol sohkeijin gam akihom tauve.   
\s1 Caleb Hebron Khopi Kipe  
\p
\v 6 Gilgal achun Judah chate thalheng in mi phabep Kenizz mi kitipa, Jephunneh chapa Caleb lamkai nan ahung kitol tauvin, Joshua jah a chun hitin aseijin, “Kadesh-barnea kiti mun a chu kei le nang chung chang thudol'a Pakaijin Pathen mi Mose jah a ipi ana seipeh geldoh in. \x + \xo 14:6 \xt Minbu 14:30\x*  
\v 7 Pakai lhacha Mose Kadesh-barnea mun'a konna Canaan gam ve-lhi dia eina sol chun keima kum somli kana lhingtai, hichea chun keiman ka lungsunga kahet chan chu Mose henga thu kahin lhutnin ahi. \x + \xo 14:7 \xt Minbu 13:1-30\x*  
\v 8 Ahinla kache khompi kasopiho chun Gamtep Gam jotlut ding chu mipi lungthim asulhadeh jengun ahi, ahinlah kei vangin Pakai ka Pathen chu lungthim pumpin kajui lhum keijin ahi.  
\v 9 Hijeh chun hiche nikho chun, Mose akihahsel in aseitan ahi, ”Tahbeh in na kengphangin achotphana muntin chu a itih a nang le na chilhah te goulo ding ahi, ajeh chu nangin Pakai ka Pathen chu na juilhum keiyin ahi” eina tin ahi. \x + \xo 14:9 \xt Minbu 14:24\x*   
\p
\v 10 “Tun vetan, Pakiyin aseibang bangin Israel gamthip gam'a akitolle laiya Pakaijin Mose jah a hiche thu ana seija pat tuphat gei hin keima eihinghoi nalaiyin, tuhin kum somget le nga kalhingtai.  
\v 11 Tuni geihin Mose’n gamvea einasol lai bangin katha ahat nalaiyin, hichepet a ka thahat bang bangin kahat nalaiyin, galkon thei leh gallamkai thei kahi nalaije.  
\v 12 Chuti ahijeh chun chuche nikhoa Pakaijin eina teppeh bang-bang chun hiche mol khu neipe tan. Gam ve-lhai ichelai uva thupitah a khopi kul kigetkhum ho sunga cheng Anak chilhah ho chu nahen ahi. Ahijeng vang'in Pakaijin eiumpi leh Aman aseibang banga amaho khu kajoa kanodoh ding ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 13 Hiti chun Jephunneh chapa Caleb chu Joshua’n phatthei aboh in ama chan tum dingin Hebron chu anape tan ahi.  
\v 14 Hebron gam chu Keniz mi Jephunneh chapa Caleb a ahi ajeh chu aman alungthim pumpin Pakai, Israel Pathen chu ana juijin ahi.  
\v 15 (Tumasang chun Hebron hi Kiriath-arba ana kitin ahi. Hiche hi Anak chilhah gal hatpenpa Arba min'a kisah ahi.)  
\p Hiti chun gam leiset chu galdouna a kon'in ana kicholdo tan ahi.   
\c 15  
\s1 Judah Phung Mite Gam Kipe  
\p
\v 1 Judah phung sunga chun a insung dungjui cheh a achan diu chu hiti hin akihoppeh in ahi. Zin gammanga Edom gamgi lhanglang chu alhangnung penna gamgi chu ahitai.   
\b  
\pmo
\v 2 Chuleh lhanglang gamgi chu lhanglang twikol apat Chitwilen lang chan gei ahin,  
\v 3 hiti chun Akrabbim lhanglang ninga achesuh in Zin gam ahopan, Kadesh-barnea lhanglang ning langa akaltouvin, chuleh Hezron ahopan chuleh Adar langa akaltouvin chuleh Karka vel kollang ahopan ahi.  
\v 4 Hichea kon chun Azmon lang ajonin achainan Egypt vadung langa achepeh in Mediterranean Twikhanglen chan gei alhungin ahi. Hiche hi amaho lhanglang gamgi chu ahitai.   
\pm
\v 5 Chutengleh solam gamgichu Chitwilen chan gei akilhung doh in Jordan kom chan geijin achepeh in ahi. Sahlang gamkaiya gamgi chu Jordan vadung ola chun akipanin. Chitwilen achun alonglutnin ahi.  
\v 6 Beth-hoglah a kon'in achetouvin Beth-arabah sahlang geijin ache in Bohan songphung geiya chu gamgi akilhungdoh peh in ahi. (Bohan chu Reuben chapa ahi).  
\v 7 Hichea patna gamgi chu Achor phaicham apat Debir chan, Gilgal langa chetouva ahi. Hiche hi Adummin kaltouna masang ahi. Gamgi chu En-shemesh twitah geijin achepeh in En-rogel mun'ah akichaijin ahi.  
\v 8 Gamgi chun Ben-Hinnom phaicham chu apal galkaijin Jerusalem khopi kitundohna munlang Jebus mite chenna lhangsuh achun akilhungdoh peh in ahi.  
\v 9 Hichea kon chun gamgi molsang chungvum'a kon'in ahung kijedoh in, Nephtoah twiputna chan geijin achetoupeh in, hichea kon chun Ephron lhang khopiho chan geijin akilhunglut in ahi. Hichea kon chun Baalah (Hichu Kiriath-jearim akiti’e) a kiheilut ahi.  
\v 10 Gamgi chun Baalah lhumlam avellin Seir thinglhang chu ajonlutnin, Jearim Molsang sahlama Kesalon khopi sung ahopan, chuin Beth-shemesh langa akigolsuh in, Timnah lang ajotpaije.  
\v 11 Hichea kon chun gamgi chu Ekron sahlang thinglhang chu ajonlutnin hichea kon chun Shikkeron leh Baalah lhanglang ajonin ahi. Hiche ban a chun Jabneel ahopan Mediterranean twikhanglen'ah akichaijin ahi.   
\pm
\v 12 Lhumlam gamgi chu Mediterranean twikhanglen pangjui chu ahipeh e.  
\b  
\m Hiche hi Juda phung bahkaiho gamgi chu ahi.   
\s1 Caleb Dinga Gam Kipe  
\p
\v 13 Pakaijin Judah gamkai khat chu Jephunneh chapa Caleb apeh dingin Joshua chu thu apen ahi. Hijeh chun Caleb chu Kiriath-arba (Hebron tina ahi) khopi chu apen ahi. Hiche Hebron hi Anak apu apateu min khat a ana kiminvo ahi. \x + \xo 15:13 \xt Thutan Vaihom Ho 1:20\x*  
\v 14 Caleb chun Anak chate Sheshai, Ahiman leh Talmai chilhah hon thum ho chu ana nodoh in ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Hichea kon chun Debir khopi (tumasanga chu Kiriath-sepher kiti ahi) a chengte gal kisatpi din ana kontai.  
\v 16 Caleb in aseijin, “Koi hileh Kiriath-sepher nokhumna gal'a gajou pen chu ka chanu Acsah akichenpi dinga kapeh ding ahi” ati.  
\v 17 Caleb sopipa Kenaz chapa Othniel chun aga joutan ahileh Acsah chu Othniel ji ahung hitai.   
\p
\v 18 Acsah in Othniel akichenpi chun amanun apa kom'a loumun khat thum din ajipa chu angeh in ahi. Amanu asangan chunga konna akum lhah chun Caleb in “Ipi nadei ham?” tin ana donge.   
\p
\v 19 Amanun aseijin, “Negev a gam khat bon neipeh ahitah leh twinah khat jong nei pehthan” ati. Hiti chun Caleb injong sahlang twinah leh lhanglang twinah khat apen ahi.   
\s1 Judah Phung Mite Khopi Ho  
\p
\v 20 Hiche hi Judah phung bahkai dungjuiya a insung cheh uva achenna diu kipe chu ahi.   
\b  
\pmo
\v 21 Judah khopiho chu Edom gamgi chin anoinung penna umho chu: Kabzeel, Eder, Jagur,  
\v 22 Kinah, Dimonah, Adadah,  
\v 23 Kedesh, Hazor, Ithnan,  
\v 24 Ziph, Telem, Bealoth,  
\v 25 Hazor-hadattah, Kerioth-hezron (Hichu Hazor tina ),  
\v 26 Amam, Shema, Moladah,  
\v 27 Hazar-gaddah, Heshmon, Beth-pelet,  
\v 28 Hazar-shual, Beersheba, Biziothiah,  
\v 29 Baalah, Iim, Ezem,  
\v 30 Eltolad, Kesil, Hormah,  
\v 31 Ziklag, Madmannah, Sansannah,  
\v 32 Lebaoth, Shilhim, Ain chuleh Rimmon–agoma khopi somni le ko chule avel'a khojouse ahi.   
\pm
\v 33 Lhumlam molbulla um khopi ho chengse jong hi Judah anakipe ho chu ahiuve: Eshtaol, Zorah, Ashnah,  
\v 34 Zanoah, En-gannim, Tappuah, Enam,  
\v 35 Jarmuth, Adullam, Socoh, Azekah,  
\v 36 Shaaraim, Adithaim, Gederah chuleh Gederothaim – khopi som le li toh avel'a khojouse ahi.   
\pm
\v 37 Hiche tilouvin jong, Zenan, Hadashah, Migdal-gad,  
\v 38 Dilean, Mizpeh, Joktheel,  
\v 39 Lachish, Bozkath, Eglon,  
\v 40 Cabbon, Lahmam, Kitlish,  
\v 41 Gederoth, Beth-dagon, Naamah chuleh Makkedah – khopi som le gup le avel'a khojouse jong ahi.   
\pm
\v 42 Hiche tilouvin jong, Libnah, Ether, Ashan,  
\v 43 Iphtah, Ashnah, Nezib,  
\v 44 Keilah, Aczib chule Mareshah – khopi ko ho leh avel'a khojouse ahiuve.   
\pm
\v 45 Judah phung miten atoupha diuva kipe gam ho chu Ekron leh avel'a khoho jong ahopmin ahi.  
\v 46 Ekron a kon chun lhumlam gamgi chin geijin akijedoh in Ashdod kom'a khoho jouse jong ahop in ahi.  
\v 47 Ashdod vel'a khojouse chule Gaza le asunga khojouse, Egypt vadung leh Mediterranean twikhanglen pang chan gei ahopmin ahi.   
\pm
\v 48 Judah chan chu noija thinglhang khopiho: Shamir, Jattir, Socoh,  
\v 49 Dannah, Kiriath-sannah (Hichu Debir tina),  
\v 50 Anab, Eshtemoh, Anim,  
\v 51 Goshen, Holon chuleh Giloh – khopi som le khat toh avel'a khoho ahiuve.   
\pm
\v 52 Chukitleh Arab khopi, Dumah, Eshan,  
\v 53 Janim, Beth-tappuah, Aphekah,  
\v 54 Humtah, Kiriath-arba (hichu Hebron tina), chuleh Zior – khopi ko leh avel'a khoho ahiuve.   
\pm
\v 55 Hiche tilou jong chun, Maon, Carmel, Ziph, Juttah,  
\v 56 Jezreel, Jokdeam, Zanoah,  
\v 57 Kain, Gibeah chuleh Timnah – khopi som leh avel'a kho ho ahiuve   
\pm
\v 58 Hiche banna jong chun Halhul, Beth-zur, Gedor,  
\v 59 Maarath, Beth-anoth chuleh Eltekon – khopi gup leh avel'a khoho ahiuve.   
\pm
\v 60 Kiriath-baal (Hichu Kiriath-jearim tina ahi) chuleh Rabbah – khopi ni leh avel'a khoho ahiuve.   
\pm
\v 61 Gamthip gam'a khopiho chun Beth-arabah, Middin, Secacah,  
\v 62 Nibshan, Chi khopi len chule En-gedi – khopi gup leh avel'a khoho ahiuve.   
\b  
\p
\v 63 Ahin Judah phungin Jerusalem a cheng Jebus mite ana nodoh jou pouvin, hijeh chun tuni chan geijin Jebus mite hi Judah te toh acheng khom jingun ahi. \x + \xo 15:63 \xt Thutan Vaihom Ho 1:21; 2 Samuel 5:6; 1 Thusimbu 11:4\x*   
\c 16  
\s1 Lhumlam Manasseh Le Ephraim Gam Kipe  
\p
\v 1 Joseph chilhah ho chan ding kipeho chu Jericho kom'a Jordan vadunga kon'in ahung kilhungin, Jericho twinah solam, gamthip gam hoipen Bethel thinglhanga alutnin ahi.  
\v 2 Bethel a kon'in Ataroth apal galkaijin Arki mite gam'a alutnin ahi.  
\v 3 Hichea kon chun lhumlam'a akum suh in Japhlet mite gam'a alutnin Beth-horon chan geijin alutnin, chea kon chun Gezer lah alutnin Mediterranean twikhanglen'a alut galkaijin ahi.  
\v 4 Hiche hi Joseph chate Manasseh leh Ephraim insung mite gamlo dinga kipe ahi.   
\s1 Ephraim Gam Kipe  
\p
\v 5 Noija ho hi Ephraim phung abahjam ho jouse achan diuva kipe ahi. Amaho gamlo ding solam gamgi chu Ataroth-addar a kipan ahi. Hichea kon chun Beth-horon sah langa alutnin,  
\v 6 chujouvin Mediterranian twikhanglen'ah alutnin ahi. Micmethath sahlanga kon'in, gamgi chu ahung kon'in Taanath-shiloh ahopan solam Janoah ajonin ahi.  
\v 7 Janoah a kon'in lhanglang ahin jonin Ataroth le Naarah a alutnin Jericho hopan Jordan vadunga atangin ahi.  
\v 8 Tappuah a patnin gamgi chu lhumlam a akilhungin Kanah vacha a kon'in Mediterranian twikhanglen na alutnin ahi. Hiche hi Ephraim phung bahkai jouse gamlo ding chu ahi.  
\v 9 Hiche banna chun khopi phabep le avel'a khoho Manasseh phung kehkhat chan dinga ana kipe jong chu Ephraim phung dingin akikoipeh tan ahi.  
\v 10 Ama hon Gezer a kon'in Canaan mite chu ana nodoh jou pouvin ahinlah Gezer mite chu tuni chan geijin Ephraim mite soh in apang tauve. \x + \xo 16:10 \xt Thutan Vaihom Ho 1:29\x*   
\c 17  
\s1 Lhumlam Manasseh Gam Kipe  
\p
\v 1 Gamlo ding kihopna aban a chu Joseph chilhah chamasa Manasseh phung akehkhat chu akipen ahi. Manasseh chapa masa Makir chu Gilead dia apa ahi. Ama chilhah ho hi gal-hat mi ahijeh un Jordan solam gamkaija um Gilead le Bashan chu ana kipesa ahi.  
\v 2 Hiti chun Jordan lhumlam gamkai Abizer, Helek, Asreil, Shechem, Hepher, chuleh Shemida ho hi Manasseh phungkhai sung lah a avat nalai insungho chan ding ahi. Hiche bahkhai ho hi Joseph cha Manasseh chilhah pasal ho thalheng ahiuve.   
\p
\v 3 Ahi jeng vang'in Manasseh chapa Makir, Makir chapa Gilead, Gilead chapa Hepher, Hepher chapa Zelophahad chu cha neilou ahin, aman chanu bou aneijin amaho min chu Malah, Noah, Haglah, Milcah chuleh Tirzah ahiuve.  
\v 4 Hiche numei ho hi, thempupa Eleazer, Nun chapa Joshua, chuleh Israel lamkaiho kom'ah ahungun hitin ahung seijun ahi, “Pakaijin, Mose jah a eiho leh kasopi teu pasal ho gamlo ding eipeh diovin thupeh anapen ahi” atiuve.  
\p Hijeh chun Joshua’n jong amaho chu Pakai thupeh banga apangah teu chan bangin gam chu anapen ahi. \x + \xo 17:4 \xt Minbu 27:1-7\x*  
\v 5 Hijeh chun Manasseh chan apumpi chu Jordan vadung galla Gilead leh Bashan gam chan banna chu gam chan som ahung lhingtan ahi.  
\v 6 Ajeh chu Manasseh chilhah numei ho jong pasal chilhah chan toh kibanga achan jeh u ahi. (Gilead gam chu Manasseh chilhah pasal amoh ho kipe ahi).   
\b  
\pmo
\v 7 Manasseh phung gamgi chu Asher gamgi hina a kon'in Secheme kom Micmethath chan geijin ahung kikholutnin ahi. Hichea kon chun gamgi chu Micmethath a kon'in achesuh in Tappuah twinah putna kom'a chenna munho geijin ahung kilhung lut in ahi.  
\v 8 Tappuah velkolla gamho chu Manasseh chan ahi. Manasseh gamgi a um Tappuah khopi tah vang chu Ephraim phung mite chan ahi.  
\v 9 Tappuah twinah putna a kon'in Manasseh gamgi chun Kanah vadungneo chu ajuijin Meditteranean twikhanglen'ah alutnin ahi. Hiche vadungneo lhanglanga khopi phabep chu Manasseh gamsung ahi, ahinla hiche ho chu atahbeh in Ephraim phungho chan ahi.  
\v 10 Alhangpi in, hiche vadungneo lhanglam gam chu Ephraim te chan ahi, chuleh vadungneo sahlang gam chu Manasseh te chan ahi. Manasseh gamgi vadungneo sahlang gamkai chutoh akilhon'in Mediterranean nah a atangin ahi. Manasseh sahlang chu Asher gam ahin chuleh sahlang vang chu Issachar gam ahi.   
\pm
\v 11 Ahivangin Issachar le Asher gamgi sunga um khopi ho, Beth-shan khopi, Ibleam khopi, Dor khopi (Hichu Naphoth-dor), Endor, Taanach khopi chule Megiddo khopi ho leh agamsunga cheng ho jouse chu Manasseh chan din ana kipe tan ahi.  
\v 12 Ahinlah Manasseh chilhah chengse chun hiche khopi ho chu ana lalut jou pouvin ahi. Ama hon Canaan mite chu ana delmang jou pouvin tuni geijin aum nalaijun ahi. \x + \xo 17:12 \xt Thutan Vaihom Ho 1:27,28\x*  
\v 13 Ahinlah khonunga Israel te ahung hatdoh phat uvin Canaan mite chu soh in amang tauvin ahi. Ahinlah agamsung uva kon'in anodoh jou pouvin ahi.   
\s1 Ephraim Le Lhumlam Manasseh Gam Thumbe  
\b  
\p
\v 14 Joseph chilhah te Joshua kom'ah ahungun hiti hin ahung dong’ui, “Pakaijin hibanga eipunsah uva ipi dinga kachenna diu gam hi chan khatbou neipeh ham?”   
\p
\v 15 Joshua’n adonbutnin “Nangho natam lheh jengtah uva Ephraim thinglhang gam nangho dinga aneotah a ahileh hiche Periz mite le Reph mite channa gammang lah khu nangho dingin gakisuhtheng tauvin,” atipeh in ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Joseph chilhah te chun adonbutnin, “Thinglhang gam hi keiho dingin alhing joupoi katiu hi atahbeh ahi. Ahinlah Canaan mite gamnom'a cheng ho leh Jezreel phaicham'a um ho hin thih sakol kangtalai aneiyun, amaho hi keihon kadou diuvin ahahsa val'e,” atiuve.   
\p
\v 17 Hichun Joshua’n Joseph chilhah te Ephraim le Manasseh phung mite ho kom'ah hitin aseije “Nangho hi natam uvin nahat lheh jeng tauve ahileh nangho dinga hi chan khat val kipe ding nahiuve.  
\v 18 Thinglhang gammang lah khu nangho nachan bediu ahi. Nanghon nasuhtheng nom chanun gaki suhthengun agamlapen aningkoi chan geijin galo tauvin phaicham'a Canaan mite jeng jong khu hat lheh uhenlang thih sakol kangtalai nei jongleu ganodoh tauvin,” ati.   
\c 18  
\s1 Gam Amoh Cheng Kikhopna  
\p
\v 1 Tunvang gamsung chu Israel te khut noiya uma ahitai, Israel mite chu abonchauvin Shiloh a akikhomun hichea chun kikhopna ponbuhkhat atungdohn tauve.  
\v 2 Ahinlah hichea chun phung sagi ho chu alodiu chennagam kipeloulai aum nalaijin ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Hichun Joshua’n amaho chu adongin, “Napu napa teu Pakai napu napa te Pathen'in nalo diuva napeh u gam nachan diu chu itih chan gei nanga diu ham?” ati.  
\v 4 “Phungkhat a mithum cheh hinlhengdoh unlang keiman amaho chu gam vetoh dingin gahsol intin, amaho cheuvin tin amaho cheh in alo diu gam chu hinvetoh untin keikom'a thu ahin lhut kit diu ahi.  
\v 5 Judah ten achannu lhanglam gamleh Joseph in achennao sahlang gam panglouva ama hon agamvet uchu hop sagi’a ahopdiu ahi.  
\v 6 Hitia chu ama hon agamvet u ajihlutnao chu keikom'a ahin choilutdiu, aphungdungjuiya achondiu akipehtheina dinga keiman Pakai I-Pathen'u angsung’a vang theng kasanding ahi.   
\p
\v 7 “Levi te chun gamchan aneiloudiu ahi. Amaho chan ding chu Pathen thempu kinbol chu hi ding ahi. Chuleh Gad, Reuben leh Manasseh phung kehkhat ho chu gam chanbeloudiu ahitai. Ajeh chu Pakai lhacha Mose’n amaho chu Jordan vadung solam gamkaija anapehsa ahitan ama hon gamchan chu akimusao ahitai,” ati.   
\p
\v 8 Amaho gam gakholtoh ding leh gajihdoh dinga akipatdoh uchun Joshua’n hitin thupeh ananeijin ahi, “Cheuvinlang agamchu gakholtoh unlang kichihtah in hinjihdoh un. Chujou teng kakom'a hungun, huting keiman Shiloh munna Pakai angsung’a vangsan na kanei ding chuteng aphung dungjui a agam chu kahoppehdiu nahiuve” ati.  
\v 9 Miho chun gampumpi chu agakholtoh dungjuijin ahin jihdoh un khopi ding leh khoneoding agongtoh un hopsagi in ahom'un lekhabua ajihkit un Shiloh ngahmunna Joshua kom'a ahinpo lutnun ahi.  
\v 10 Chuleh Shiloh achun Joshua'n Pakai angsung’a vangsan’na aneijin hoilai munchu koi phungpen chang dingham ti avetan ahi.   
\s1 Benjamin Phungmite Gam Kipe  
\p
\v 11 Vang kivetna-a chan masa chu Benjamin phunga alhungin ahi. Hiche chan hi Judah le Joseph gamchan kikah’a um gam chu ahi.   
\b  
\pmo
\v 12 Benjamin channa sahlang gamgi chu Jordan vadunga hung kipan ahin, Jericho sahlang juilang ajonnin, hiti chun lhumlama thinglhang gamleh Beth-aven ahin pal galkaijin ahi.  
\v 13 Hiche apatin gamhi chu Luz (Bethel tina) lhanglama achepeh in hijou chun achesuh in noinung Beth-horon lhanglam thinglhang chunga um Ataroth-addar munna alutnin ahi.   
\pm
\v 14 Gamgi chu ahung kileheijin lhanglang ajonsuh in Beth-horon maingat thinglhang lhumlam gei hina alutnin Kiriath-baal (Keriath-jearim tina) khokhatna atangin ahi. Hiche hi Judah phung khopi khat ahi. Hiche hi lhumlam gamgi chu ahi.   
\pm
\v 15 Lhanglam gamgi chu Kiriath-jearim khopamma kon'in ahung kipanne. Hiche lhumlam gamchinna konhin ahung kilhungin Naphtoah twinah put namun ahinjotpan,  
\v 16 Ben-Hinnom phaicham pangmol bullah alutnin ahi. Hiche hi Rephaim phaicham sahlang kichaina mun ahi. Hichea konhin Hinnom phaicham'a achesuh peh-in Jebus mite chenna lhanglam suh apaltannin En-Rogel chan gei in achonlut peh in ahi.  
\v 17 En-Rogel gamgia kon'in sahlang jotna lammah alutnin En-Shemesh ahinjonin Geliloth (Adummin langa kaltouna toh kigalsai ahitai) chunga alut jellin ahi. Hichea konhin Bohan (Reuben chapa min) songphung geijin achesuh in ahi.  
\v 18 Hichea konhin Jordan phaicham hin galdotna sahlang gamkai langa achepeh in ahi. Hiti chun gamgi chu phaicham lamma achesuh in ahi.  
\v 19 Beth-hoglah sahlang lhang apal galkaijin Chitwi-len sahlang pangah alongin ahi. Hiche hi Jordan vadung lhang langa achaina ahitai. Hiche lhanglang gamgi chu ahitai.   
\pm
\v 20 Solam gamgi chu Jordan vadung ahitai.  
\b  
\m Hiche hi Benjamin phung bahkai ho jouse gamlo dinga kipe gamgi chu ahi.   
\s1 Benjamin Kipe Khopi Ho  
\m
\v 21 Hiche ho hi Benjamin phung sunga abahkai ho kipe khopi chu ahi.  
\b  
\pmo Beth-hoglah, Emek-keziz,  
\v 22 Beth-arabah, Zemaraim, Bethel,  
\v 23 Avvim, Parah, Ophrah,  
\v 24 Kephar-ammoni, Ophni, and Geba— khopi som le ni chule  vella khoho ahiuve  
\v 25 Chujongleh Gibeon, Ramah, Beeroth,  
\v 26 Mizpeh, Kephirah, Mozah,  
\v 27 Rekem, Irpeel, Taralah,  
\v 28 Zela, Haeleph, Jebus (hichu Jerusalem), Gibeah, and Kiriath-jearim — khopi somleli chule  avel'a khoho ahiuve.  
\b  
\m Hicheng hi Benjamin phungmite le abahkai ho lodia kipe gam ho chu ahi.   
\c 19  
\s1 Simeon Phung Mite Gam Kipe  
\p
\v 1 Ani channa a alo diuva gam kipe chu Simeon phung sunga phung bahkaiho chu ahiuve.   
\b  
\pmo
\v 2 Simeon gamlo dinga kipe ho chu Beersheba, Sheba, Moladah, \x + \xo 19:2 \xt 1 Thusimbu 4:28-33\x*  
\v 3 Hazar-shual, Belah, Ezem,  
\v 4 Eltolad, Bethul, Hormah,  
\v 5 Ziklag, Beth-marcaboth, Hazar-susah,  
\v 6 Beth-lebaoth chuleh Sharuhen khopi som le thum toh avel'a khoho puma ahop ahi.  
\v 7 Hichun Ain, Rimmon, Ether, chule Ashan khopi li hotoh akhoneo ho jong ahop in,  
\v 8 avel uva khohop jouse toh Baalath-beer (Negev a Ramah jong akitin ahi) ahi.  
\b  
\m Hiche ho hi Simeon phung le abahkhai ho gamlo dinga kipea chu ahi.  
\v 9 Amaho kipe gam hi Judah te gamphabep kikahlha a kipe ahi. Ajeh chu Judah gam chu amaho dinga analen valla ahi. Hijeh chun Judah gamsunga kon'in Simeon phungin gam chan phabep aneijin ahi.   
\s1 Zebulun Mite Gam Kipe  
\p
\v 10 Athum channa gamlo ding chan kipe chu: Zebulun phung sunga abahkhai ho ahiuve.  
\b  
\pmo Zebulun chenna gamgi chu Sarid a hung kipan ahi.  
\v 11 Hichea kon chun lhumlam'a achen Maralah ahopan Dabbesheth akhokhellin Jokneam vadungneo lang ajonin ahi.  
\v 12 Sarid apat chun agamgi hi gamchom jep a akiheijin, Kishloth-tabor gamgi lang nisolam'a nisa hung sodohna lam ajontai. Chuin Daberath lang ajon kitnin, Japhia langa akilhung touve,  
\v 13 Japhia apat chun nisolam ahin lhah in nisa hung sodohjina Gath-hepher gal Eth-kazin geijin ahung kilhung paiyin chuin Rimmon chanin akilhung doh peh in Neah lang jonin ahung kiheikon tai.  
\v 14 Abanin sahlam'a agamgi chu Hannathon langa akiheijin Iphtah-el phaiya abeitai.  
\v 15 Khopi ho chu Kattath ahin, Nahalal ahin, Shimron ahin, Idalah ahin, chuleh Bethlehem toh ahi, khopi som le ni toh akhoneo jouse toh ahithai.   
\b  
\m
\v 16 Hicheng hi Zebulun chate chan agam goulo ahin a insung dungjui uva khopi hicheng toh akhoneo jouse toh chantha ahiuve.   
\s1 Issachar Phung Mite Gam Kipe  
\p
\v 17 Ali channa gamlo ding chan kipe chu Issachar phung mite le asunga abahkhai ho ahiuve.   
\b  
\pmo
\v 18 Agamgi hop sunga chun Jezreel jong, Kesulloth jong Shunem jong.  
\v 19 Hapharaim jong, Shion jong, Anaharath jong,  
\v 20 Rabbith jong Kishion jong, Ebez jong,  
\v 21 Remeth, En-gannim jong En-haddah jong, Beth-pazzez jong ahopdoh tai.  
\v 22 Agamgi chun Tabor jong, Shahazuman jong, chule Beth-shemesh jong ahopan, Jordan vadungah chun agamgi abeitai. Khopi som le gup toh akhoneo jouse toh ahiye.   
\b  
\m
\v 23 Hiche hi Issachar chate phung miho goulo achan diu ahin, a insung dungjuijin khopi chujat chutoh khoneo chengse toh achantha tauve.   
\s1 Asher Phung Mite Gam Kipe  
\p
\v 24 Anga channa gamlo ding chan kipe chu Asher phung mite le asunga abahkhai ho ahiuve.   
\b  
\pmo
\v 25 Agam chu Helkath jong Hali jong , Beten jong, Achshaph jong,  
\v 26 Allammelech jong, Amad jong chule Mishal jong ahoptai, nilhum lam'a Carmel le Shihor-libnath jong ahopsoh keijin,  
\v 27 chuin agamgi’n nisolam ajotnin, Beth-dagon geijin akilhungin, Zebulun leh Iphtahel phaicham ahopan, sahlam alhah in, Beth-emek leh Neiel geijin akilhung lut in ahi. Chujouvin jong agamgi chu Cabul sahlam'a achen,  
\v 28 Ebron lam, Rehob lam, Hammon lam, Kanah lam ajonin, Sidon lenpa geijin akilhung lutne.  
\v 29 Hichun Ramah lam'a agamgi chu ahung kihei kitnin Tyre khopi kulpi kikai khum chu ahinpha peh in ahi. Chujouvin Hosah lam jonin akihei kitnin chule Mediterranian twilen a atangtai. Mehebel jong, Achzib jong,  
\v 30 Ummah jong, Aphek jong, chule Rehob jong ahin, khopi somninle nintoh akhoneo jouse jong ahi.   
\b  
\m
\v 31 Hiche hi a insungu dungjuiya Asher chate phung goulo ahin, khopi hijat leh akhoneo jouse toh ahiye.   
\s1 Naphtali Phung Mite Gam Kipe  
\p
\v 32 Agup channa gamlo ding chan kipe chu Naphtali phung mite le asunga abahkai ho ahiuve.   
\b  
\pmo
\v 33 Agamgi chu Heleph a kipat, Zaanannim gangpi phung'a pat, chule Adami-nekeb apat, Jabneel apat Lakkum chan geijin akilhung lut peh in, chuin Jordan vadunga atangtai.  
\v 34 Chujouvin agamgi chu nilhum lam'a akiheijin, Aznoth-tabor lam ajonnin chua kon'in Hukkok lam ajonpai paijin lhanglam'a Zebulun ahopan nilhum langa Asher gamgi ahopa kitnin nisolam'a Jordan vadung ajuijin ahi.  
\v 35 Kulpi kikaikhum ho chu, Ziddim ahin, Zer ahin, Hammath ahin, Rakkath ahin, Kinnereth ahi.  
\v 36 Adamah ahin, Ramah ahin, Hazor ahin,  
\v 37 Kedesh ahin, Edrei ahin, En-hazor ahin,  
\v 38 Yiron ahin, Migdal-el ahin, Beth-anath ahin, chule Beth-shemesh ahi, khopi som le ko toh khoneo chengse toh ahiye.  
\v 39 A insung utoh kithuh bepma hicheng hi Naphtali chate phung chan agam u ahi, khopi ho hi ahin khoneo ho ahin akisim than ahi.   
\s1 Dan Phung Mite Gam Kipe  
\p
\v 40 Asagi channa gamlo ding chan kipe chu Dan phung mite le asunga abahkai ho ahiuve.   
\b  
\pmo
\v 41 Chule Dan phung chan agoulo gam chu: Zorah jong, Eshtaol jong Ir-shemesh jong,  
\v 42 Shalabbin jong, Aijalon jong, Ithlah jong,  
\v 43 Elon jong Timnath jong, Ekron jong ahin,  
\v 44 Eltekah jong, Gibbethon jong, Baalath jong,  
\v 45 Jehud jong, Bene-berak jong, Gath-rimmon jong,  
\v 46 Chule Me-jarkon le Rakkon toh Joppa to kimai ngat gamsung se-se jong ahop sohkeijin ahi.  
\v 47 Dan chaten agamsung achanlou phat uvin akon touvun Laish khopi agasat uvin, alah jouvun chemjamin asat gamhel uvin atoupha uvin asunga acheng tauve. Laish jong chu apu apau min aputsah uvin Dan asah tauve. \x + \xo 19:47 \xt Thutan Vaihom Ho 18:27-29\x*  
\v 48 Hicheng hi a insung tohkham bepma Dan chate phunggoul achan u khopi ho jong khoneo ho jong ahithai.   
\s1 Joshua Gam Kipe  
\p
\v 49 Gamsung chu abih-bih a gouloa chenpha dia akihopsoh phat uvin, Israel chaten Nun chapa Joshua jong chu alah uva goulo ding gam apeuvin ahi.  
\v 50 Pakai thusah in Israel ten Joshua chu athumpen pen khopi Timnath-serah kiti, Ephraim thinglhang gamsunga khopi chu ape tauve. Aman jong akhopi chu akisah phatnin chennan aneitan ahi.   
\p
\v 51 Eleazer thempupa leh Nun chapa Joshua chule Israel aphungkhai leh a insung dungjui uva alamkai houvin Shiloh munna Pakai angsung laitah a vang asan uva ana hopdoh peh nau gam ahin, hichu Pakai chenna ponbuh kotpi phunga anahop u ahiye. Hiti chun ama hon agam chu ahomsoh tauvin ahi.   
\c 20  
\s1 Hoidohna Thei Khopi Ho  
\p
\v 1 Pakaijin Joshua kom'ah aseije, \x + \xo 20:1 \xt Minbu 35:9-34; Danbu Ni Na 4:41-43; 19:1-13\x*  
\v 2 “Tun keiman Mose kana seipeh bangin Israel te chun kiselna ding khopiho chu akilhendoh diuvin seipeh tan.  
\v 3 ‘Koitobang hamkhat in mikhat tou tupna mong umlouva ahilouleh hettoh louva ahin tha khah tah a ahileh athatpa chunga phulanom athipa sopiho khutna konna ajamlutna ding kiselna khopi ho um ding ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Hiche khopiho khatpen’a hi ajamlut teng hiche mithatpa hi khopi kelkot phunga upaho masanga achungthu akiphondoh ding, ama hon hiche pa hi khopi sunga alutsah uva amaho kom'a achen theina ding agonpeh diu ahi.  
\v 5 Ijemtia athipa insung mite chu phula dinga ahungu leh lamkai ho chun mithatpa chu amaho kom'a apehlut louding ahi, ajeh chu amapa chun tumasanga kinahna umlou chuleh tupna mong imacha umlouva khutsoiya ana tha khah jeh ahi.  
\v 6 Ahinlah mithatpa chu hiche khopia chu umden ding, khopi chun achung thu akhol toh uva athu atan diu ahi, chuleh hiche thilso petna Thempu Chungnung natongpa hinlaisea hiche kom'a chu cheng ding ahi. Hijouteng chuleh ahung jamdohna khopi sung a-inmun'a chu kilekit thei ding ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Hiche ho hi kiselna khopi ho chu: Naphtali thinglhang gam'a din Galilee a um Kadesh, Ephraim thinglhang gam'a din Sechem, Judah thinglhang gam'a din Kiriath-arba (Hebron tina),  
\v 8 Jericho gallang Jordan vadung solama din hiche khopiho hi alhengdoh un ahi: Reuben phung phaicham gammang langa din Bezer; Gad phung mite gamsunga din Gilead a um Ramoth, Manasseh phung mite gamsunga din Bashan’a um Golan ahiuve.  
\v 9 Israel te hihen alah uva cheng gamchom miho hijongleh hiche khopi ho hi kigonpeh a ahiuve. Hiche hi amun khoppi masanga thu kikholna umman louva phulahna a kilhana dinga konna hoidohna aum theina dinga tohgon ahi.   
\c 21  
\s1 Levi Phung Mite Khopi Ho  
\p
\v 1 Hiche jou chun Levi phung sunga lamkaiho chu ahungun Eleazer thempupa toh, Nun chapa Joshua toh chuleh Israel pumpi phung lamkaiho ahung kihoutoh piuvin ahi.  
\v 2 Amaho chu Canaan gam'a Shiloh munna ahungun hiti hin asei uve, “Keiho hi ka gancha teu neh ding hampa phatna gam leh keiho chenna ding khopiho eipehna diuvin Pakaijin Mose kom'ah ana seijin ahi,” atiuve. \x + \xo 21:2 \xt Minbu 35:1-8\x*  
\v 3 Hiti chun Pakai thupeh dungjuijin Israel mipite chun hiche khopiho le hampa phatna gamho hi amaho gam chan dingin Levi te chu ana peuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Levi phung sunga konna Kohath phung bahkai insung miho Aaron chilhah ho chu atil abul'a Judah, Simeon leh Benjamin phungho ana kipe khopi som le thum ho chu ape tauvin ahi.  
\v 5 Tumasang Ephraim, Dan leh Manasseh phung akehkhat ana kipesa khopi somkhat chu Kohath phungkhai insung midang ho chu ana peuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Tumasang’a Issachar, Asher, Naphtali chuleh Manasseh phung kehkhat ana kipesa khopi som le thum chu Gershon phung bahkai ho chu ana peuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Tumasang’a Reuben, Gad leh Zebulun phungho ana kipesa khopi som le ni ho chu Merari phungkai ho chu ana peuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Pakaijin Mose ana thupeh dungjuijin Israel chaten khopi hichengse hileh hamhing phatna gam hicheng hi vang kisanpeh bang-banga Levi te anapeh u ahiye.   
\p
\v 9 Judah leh Simeon phunga kon'in Israel chaten khopi hichengse hi anape tauve.  
\v 10 Akhopi chengse hi Aaron chilhah ho Kohath chate insung leh Levi miho ma-ma insung khat acheng tauvin ahi, ajeh chu vang kisan chu amaho dia hung masa ahi.  
\v 11 Israel chaten amaho chu Kiriath-arba kiti (hichea Arba hi Anak pa ahin, akhopi Hebron jong akiti) Juda thinglhang gam'a khopi le akimvel'a hamhing gam chengse chu ape tauve.  
\v 12 Khopi gal'a loujao chengse le akhoneo ho vang chu Jephunneh chapa Caleb chenna dinga kipesa ahitai.   
\p
\v 13 Aaron thempupa chilhah te chu Israel chaten mithat ho kiselna khopi Hebron le ahamhing gamsung jouse apeuvin, Libnah le ahamhing gam pumpi jong ana peuve.  
\v 14 Jattir khopi le Eshtemoa ahamhing gam jong apeuvin ahi.  
\v 15 Holon le ahamhing gam jouse apeuvin, Debir le hamhing gam jong apehtha uvin ahi.  
\v 16 Chule Ain khopi le ahamhing gamsung apehtha uvin, Juttah le ahamhing gam jong apeuve. Beth-shemesh le ahamhing apehtha uvin, hiti chun hiche phungni sunga kon hin khopi ko apedoh tauve.   
\p
\v 17 Benjamin phunga kon'in Gibeon khopi le ahamhing gam jong apeuvin, Geba le ahamhing gam jong apeuvin,  
\v 18 Anathoth khopi le ahamhing gamsung se-se toh apumin Almon khopi le ahamhing gamsungse jong apeuvin ahi.  
\v 19 Aaron thempupa chilhah achate chan khopi chengse chu abonchan khopi som le thum toh ahamhing gamsungse toh ahopthan ahi.   
\p
\v 20 Levi mite lah a Kohath insungmi, Kohath chate amoh chengse chu Ephraim phunga konna achan diu khopi akihoppeh tai.  
\v 21 Hiche Kohath chate amoh chengse chu mithat ho kiselna ding khopi Shechem le ahamhing gamsunga Ephraim thinglhang gamsung chu apeuvin, Gezer khopi le ahamhing gamsung jong apeuvin ahi.  
\v 22 Kibzaim khopi le ahamhing gam jong apeuve, khopi li alhingin ahi.   
\p
\v 23 Chule Dan phunga kon'in Eltekeh khopi le ahamhing gam apeuvin Gibbethon khopi le ahamhing gam apeuve;  
\v 24 Aijalon khopi le ahamhing gam jong apeuve, khopi li ma alhingin ahi.   
\p
\v 25 Manasseh phunga kon'in jong Taanach khopi le ahamhing gam apeuvin Gath-rimmon khopi le ahamhing gam apeuve; hichu khopi ni ahi.  
\v 26 Kohath chate amoh chengse insung mite chan khopi chu abonchan khopi somkhat le ahamhing gam jouse toh ahopthai.   
\p
\v 27 Levi te inko lah a insung khat Gershon chate jong chu Manasseh phung kehkhat a kon'in asan diu chu apeuvin, Bashan gamsungse Golan khopi le ahamhing gamsungse apeuve; hiche khopi jong mithat ho kiselna khopi ma-ma ahi, chule Be-eshterah khopi le ahamhing gamsung jong ahin, khopi ni hi apeuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 28 Chujongleh Issachar phunga kon'in jong Kishion khopi le ahamhing gamsung apeuvin, Daberath khopi le ahamhing gamsung se-se jong apeuve.  
\v 29 Chule Jarmuth khopi le ahamhing gamsung apeuvin, En-gannim khopi le ahamhing gamsung jong apehtha uvin ahile, khopi li alhingin ahi.   
\p
\v 30 Asher phunga kon'in jong Mishal leh Abdon khopi le ahamhing gam jong apeuve,  
\v 31 Helkath khopi le ahamhing gamsung jong apeuvin chule Rehob khopi le ahamhing gam jong apeuvin ahileh khopi li ma alhingtai.   
\p
\v 32 Naphtali phung sunga kon'in jong Galilee gamsunga Kedesh le ahamhing gamsung jong apeuvin, hiche khopi jong hi mithat ho kiselna khopi ma ahi, Hammoth-dor le ahamhing gamsung jong apeuvin, chule Kartan khopi le ahamhing gamsung jong apehtha uvin, abonin khopi thum alhingtai.  
\v 33 Gershon chate inko chujat dinga khopi kipedoh chengse chu abonchan khopi som le thum alhingin ahamhing gamsung se-se toh ahi tha cheh in ahi.   
\p
\v 34 Levi te mi amoh chengse, Merari chate chu Zubulun phunga kon'in achan diu akipen, Jokneam khopi le ahamhing gamsung apeuvin, Kartah khopi le ahamhing gamsung apeuve.  
\v 35 Dimnah khopi le ahamhing gamsungse apeuvin, Nahalal khopi le ahamhing gamsung jong apeuve, abonin khopi li alhingin ahi.   
\p
\v 36 Reuben phunga kon'in jong Bezer khopi le ahamhing gamsung chu apeuvin, Jahaz khopi le ahamhing gamsungse jong apeuve.  
\v 37 Kedemoth khopi le ahamhing gamsungse apeuvin chule Mephaath khopi le ahamhing gamsungse jong apeuvin ahileh khopi li alhinge.   
\p
\v 38 Gad phunga kon'in jong Gilead gamsunga Ramoth khopi le ahamhing gamsungse apeuvin, hiche khopi jong hi mithat ho kiselna khopi ma-ma ahiye; Mahanaim khopi le ahamhing gamsung jong apeuvin,  
\v 39 Heshbon khopi le ahamhing gamsungse jong apeuvin, Jazer khopi le ahamhing gamsungse apeuvin ahileh abonin khopi li alhingin ahi.  
\v 40 Merari chate inko chujatpi Levi inkote lah a aum nalaiho dia kipedoh khopi chengse abonchan khopi som le ni alhingin ahi.   
\p
\v 41 Israel chate lah a Levi te khopi chengse chu abonin khopi somli le get alhingin, ahamhing gamsung se-se toh ahitha cheh in ahi.  
\v 42 Khopi hijat chun akimvel khopam dunga hamhing gam anei cheh uvin, hitobanga hi khopi chujat chu changsoh hel ahiuve.   
\p
\v 43 Hitobang hin apu apateu henga akihahselna bang bangin Pakaijin Canaan gam pumpi chu Israel te apetai; Israel ten jong agam pumpi chu atoupha uvin acheng tauve.  
\v 44 Chujongleh apu apateu henga akihahselna bang chun Pakaijin Israel te chu ajet aveiya mitea kon'in akicholdo sahtai; agalteu khatna khat jengcha jong amaho ting tan jouvah abeihel tan ahi; ijeh nem itileh Pakaijin agalteu abonchan akhut uva apedoh tan ahi.  
\v 45 Pakaijin Israel te insung dinga akitepna pha chengse chu khatcha alhinglel abei hellin, abonchan athutep chengse aguilhung sohkeijin ahi.   
\c 22  
\s1 Solam A Cheng Phungho Hung Kile  
\p
\v 1 Joshua Reuben chate le Gad chate chule Manasseh phung kehkhat chutoh akou khomin,  
\v 2 ajah uva hiti hin aseitai, “Nanghon Pakai lhacha Mose in na thupeh jouse abonchan nanit sohkeiyun, keiman nangho ka seipeh ka thusei jouse jong nangai tauve. \x + \xo 22:2 \xt Minbu 32:20-32; Joshua 1:12-15\x*  
\v 3 Nikho hijat sung tuni geijin nang hon nasopi phungdang te ho jong na dalha deh pouvin, Pakai na Pathen uvin na thupeh chengseu jong chingthei tah in nanit sohkeiyun ahi.  
\v 4 Tunvang Pakai na Pathen uvin athutep bang bangin nasopi phungdang te ho jong jong akitepna bangin akicholdo sah tai. Hijeh chun tun kiheijun lang Jordan gal lam'a Pakai lhacha Mose’n napeh nau gam, nangho chenna gamsung nagoulo u, na inlam'u jonin chetauvin.  
\v 5 Pakai lhacha Mose’n na thupeh u dan thupeh chengse chu nanit jingna diuvin ching theiyun. Pakai na Pathen'u na ngailut uva ama lamlhah jouse na juithem uva athupeh chengse nanit uva ama jong na kolchah jing uva, chule na lungthim pumpiu le na hinkho pumpiuva ama kin jeng nabol diu nagin jing diu ahi.” ati.  
\v 6 Hiti chun Joshua’n amaho chu phatthei aboh in, phatthei abohjou phatnin asoldoh tai. Amaho jong a inlam cheh uva ache tauve.   
\p
\v 7 Manasseh phung akehkhat chu Bashan gamsunga Mose’n achan diu gam ana pehsa ahin, Manasseh phung kehkhat ma chu Joshua’n Jordan vadung gal nilhum lam, asopi teu dang ho lah a chenmun anapeh ahiye. Amaho chu Joshua’n a inlam uva asoldoh phatnin abonchauvin phatthei aboh sohkeijin ahi.  
\v 8 Ajah uva Joshua’n hitin ati, “Nei le gou tampitah kipoh uvin lang gancha jong tamtah kipoh uvin lang na ponbuh akon namun cheh a kile tauvin, nagal mite uva konna na chomdoh jouseu jong kihom'un” ati.   
\p
\v 9 Hijeh chun Reuben chate le Gad chate chuleh Manasseh phung kehkhat chun Israel chate amoh chengse chu Canaan gam'a Shiloh kiti khopiah chun adalhauvin, amaho chu Pakaijin Mose athupeh banga agamlosa sung’u Gilead gamsung jonin ache tauve.   
\s1 Solam’a Cheng Hon Pathen Maicham Atundoh-U  
\p
\v 10 Ahin amaho chu Canaan sung’a aum jinglai un, Geliloth kiti mun Jordan vadung kom'ah chun, Reuben chate le Gad chate chule Manasseh phung kehkhat chu akingapa un, maicham phung lentah le thupitah khat asem'un ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Israel chaten, Reuben chate le Gad chate, chule Manasseh phung kehkhat chun Canaan gammongchin Jordan vapang lhang chung khat a Israel chate gamsunga khun maicham asem'u chu ajadoh tauve.  
\v 12 Athudol hi Israel chaten ajahdoh phatnun Shiloh mun a cheng Israel chate khopi pumpi akikhom uvin amaho chu gal a sattho din ago tauve.  
\v 13 Ahinlah, amasan, Eleazar thempu chapa Phinehas lamkainan mi phabep Reuben phung mite le Gad chule Manasseh phung kehkhat toh kihou din anasol uve.  
\v 14 Hichea kihoulimpi dia kalsong miho chu Israel phunglah a lamkai som ahiuvin, a insung khat bahkailhah a aluboh cheh, chule Israel insung phung khat cheh a konna kilhengdoh phung upa cheh mi ahiuve.   
\p
\v 15 Amaho chu Gilead gam ahunglhun phat un, Reuben chate le Gad chate chule Manasseh phung kehkhat hengah hitin asei uve,  
\v 16 Pakai khoppi amiten hitin aseijun, “Ipi dinga nang hon tulaija hi Israel Pathen douna thil nabol uva Pakai nung na juida uva nakiheimang jeng uva nacham chamma maicham nakisem jeng uva Pakai douna hitobang pihi nabol'u hitam? \x + \xo 22:16 \xt Danbu Ni Na 12:13,14\x*  
\v 17 Peor mun'a ichonset nau jong phaset nasah louvu ham? Hichea konna bon ithensoh jouloulai u hilou ham? Hiche ichonset jeh uva jong chu Pakai khoppi mipi chunga jong gamna hise ana langsa ahi. \x + \xo 22:17 \xt Minbu 25:1-9\x*  
\v 18 Tuni geija jong nangho hitobanga hi Pakai chu iti na dalhah uva na kiheimang jeng diu hitam? Tuni jenga jong nang hon Pakai doumah nabol uva ahileh ama chu Israel khoppi pumpi chung jenga jong hung lunghang jeng ding ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Na chennau gamsung athen louva ahi jongleh hung galkai unlang Pakai Houbuh kisonna gamsung Pakai gamsunga khun keiho lah a hung cheng jeng uvin, Pakai doumah hi nabol louhel diu, Pakai I-Pathen'u maicham semna tailouva nacham-nacham'a nakisem thu uva keiho geija doumah hol neiso louhel dingu ahi.  
\v 20 Suhmang dinga kikatdohsa thil ho chunga Achan kitipa Zerah chapan tohkhel anei chu Israel khoppi pumpi chunga lunghanna hung chu jengsa hilou ham?” ahung tiuve. \x + \xo 22:20 \xt Joshua 7:1-26\x*   
\p
\v 21 Reuben chate le Gad chate chule Manasseh phung kehkhat chun Israel phung sunga insungmi upaho donbutnan aneiyun,  
\v 22 “Pakai, Hatchungnung chu Pathen ahi! Pakai, Hatchungnung chu Pathen ahi! Aman thudih le thutah chu ahenai, chule Israel chaten jong nahet uva pha ahi. Keihon maicham kasem uhi Pakai doumahna dia kabol'u ahipoi. Ka thilbol uhi doumah lam ahitah a Pakai dinga tahsan suhbeina ahi ding leh keiho hi tunin eihinghoi da jeng uvin.  
\v 23 Ahin maicham khat ka semdoh jeh uva Pakai nungjuija konna kihei mangna ahi mong ding leh ahilouva keihon hiche maicham chunga hi pumgo thil hihenlang lhosoh thilto hijongleh chamna thilto hijongleh kato uva ahivang leh Pakaijin kachung uva gotna eipe jeng uhen.   
\p
\v 24 Tahbeh mongin, keihon hiche maicham kasem uhi katijat man uva kabol'u ahi bouve, ajeh chu khonung tengleh nacha teuvin ka chateu jah a, ‘Nang hon Pakai Israel Pathen chu koi thusahna a nahou uham?’ ahinti diu ahi.  
\v 25 Ajeh chu Pakaijin nangho toh Reuben chate Gad chate, ikikah uva Jordan vadung hi gamgia asemsa ahitai, khunungleh nang hon Pakaiya chan nanei pouve ati theiju ahi, hitobanga hi nacha teuvin ka chateu hi Pakai ahousah da theiyu ahi.   
\p
\v 26 Hiche jeh a chu keihon ka maicham sem uhi pumgo thilto gona ding le kilhaina ganthana ding ahipoi,  
\v 27 ahin keiho leh nangho kikah a hetjingna dia kasem'u ahi, chujongleh hichun eiho nunga khangthah te kah a jong hettohsah nan hung pangin tin, keihon jong Pakai angsunga ama kin kabol mong-mong uvin pumgo thilto jong kilhaina gantha jong chule chamna thilto gantha jong kabol nauve ti hetjingna in hung pang nante, katiu ahi. Achuti louva ahileh khonung phat leh nacha teuvin keiho chate jah a, “Nang hon Pakaiya chan nanei pouve” ahinti khah tei diu ahi tia kabol'u ahi bouve.   
\p
\v 28 Ijemtia hita chu ahinsei khah tah ujongleh, khonunga katu kacha teuvin jong, ‘Veuvin, Pakai dinga kapu kapa teuvin asemsa maicham khu pumgo thilto kitona jong hilou, kilhaina gan thana maicham jong hilou, ahin nangho leh keihon Pakaiyah chan inanei khom'ui ti melchih nan pang nante’ katiu ahi bouve.  
\v 29 Itihchan hijongleh keihon Pakai doumah kabol louhel diu ahin, chujongleh Pakai I-Pathen'u maicham ama Houbuh maiya kitung tailouva keihon kacham cham uva pumgo thilto tona ding leh lhosoh thilto tona ding chule kilhaina ganthana dia maicham kasem uva Pakai nunga konna kaki heimang louhel diu ahi” atiuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 30 Reuben chate leh Gad chate chule Manasseh phung kehkhat thusei ho jouse chu ajah doh phat uvin, Phinehas thempupa le akilhonpi khoppi lamkai ho leh Israel insung jouse phung upa chengse chu alungu alhaisel tauvin ahi.  
\v 31 Eleazer thempupa chapa Phinehas chun Reuben chate Gad chate chule Manasseh phung kehkhat jah a aseipeh in, “Ilah uva Pakai aum jing nai, ti keihon tunin kahe tauve, ijeh-inem itileh keihon nangho kana ginmo bang’un Pakai dounan thilse ima nabol hih nauve chuleh nang hon Pakai khutna kon'in jong Israel chate hi suhmang’a aum thei nauva kon'in na huhdoh tauve” atin ahi.   
\p
\v 32 Chujouvin Eleazer thempupa chapa Phinehas le lamkaiho chun Reuben chate le Gad chate Gilead gamsung’a chun adalhauvin, hikom'a kon chun Canaan gamlam, Israel chate chenna lam'a ahung kile tauvin, Israel te henga chun thilsoh um chan thu chengse chu alhut tauvin ahi.  
\v 33 Athulhut u chun Israel chate chu alungdam sah lheh jengin ahi, chuphatnin Israel chaten jong Pathen avahchoijun, Reuben chate le Gad chate chenna gamsung suhmang ding le galbol ding jong aseipoh kit tapouve.   
\p
\v 34 Reuben chate le Gad chaten maicham asemsau chu ‘Hettohsah’ tin aminsah tauvin ahi, ama hon aseijun, “Ijeh-inem itile eiho le amaho kikah a Pakai chu eiho Pathen jong ahi ti hettohsah a pang ahi,” atiuve.   
\c 23  
\s1 Joshua’n Lhahna Thu Asei  
\p
\v 1 Kum phabep ache nungin Pakaijin Israel mipite hi agal miho uva kon'in akicholdo sah tan ahi. Joshua jong ateh lheh tan,  
\v 2 aman Israel te upaho leh lamkaiho thutan ho leh vaihom ho akou khomin, aman amaho kom'a hiti hin aseije, “Tuhin keima kateh lheh tai,  
\v 3 Pakai na Pathen'un keima phat sunga hi itobang thil na bolpeh uham ti nang hon namu sohkeiyun ahi. Pakai na Pathen'un na melma teu gal nasat peh un ahi.  
\v 4 Keiman imelma teu gam ilahsahou leh ihinlah ding hou nachen nau gam dingin kahin hoppeh tauve agamsung hi Jordan vadunga pat a Mediterranean Twikhanglen lhumlam gei ahi.  
\v 5 Tun hiche hi nangho gam hi ding ahitai, ajeh chu na Pakai na Pathen'u ama tah in agamsung miho abon'a na deldoh peh dingu ahi. Nanghon agam uhi Pakai na Pathen uvin na teppeh bang uva nalo diu ahitai.   
\p
\v 6 Hijeh chun Mose’n danbua ana jihlut banga ichepi theina diuvin chingthei jep uhitin, hitia chu kijet hei hihen lang kivei hei hijongleh ichekhel louna diuvin chingthei uhite.  
\v 7 Hijeh chun hiche gamsunga um nalai ho lah a ilhahmang louna diuvin ding det uhite. Amaho semthu pathenho nahou theilou diu le akinna jong na kimanchah lou diu, kihahselna a jong naman theilou diu amin'a amin ujong naphah poh theilou diu ahi.  
\v 8 Amavang na Pakai na Pathen chu tuni geija dettah a nahin kolchah bang uva hi na kolchah jing diu ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Ajeh chu Pakaijin nam hattah tahho nahin deldoh peh un koima chan nangho hi alonaje nahe pouvin ahi.  
\v 10 Nangho mikhat seh in jong mi sangkhat nadel jam thei diu ahi, ajeh chu Pakai na Pathen uvin akitepna bangin nagal’u na satpeh tauvin ahi. \x + \xo 23:10 \xt Danbu Ni Na 32:30; \xt Danbu Ni Na 3:22\x*  
\v 11 Hijeh chun na Pakai na Pathen'u na ngailut jingna diuvin, chingtheijun,   
\p
\v 12 “Amavang nangho ama a konna na kiheimang uva nalah uva nangho toh umkhom namdang ho chon dan nalah uva amaho toh na kichento uva ahileh,  
\v 13 hiteng chuleh nakihet diu chu Pakai na Pathen uvin amaho chu na nodoh peh lou diu ahitai. Hititah sanga chu amaho joh hi nakipalna diuva na lhemlha uva hung pang diu, namit uva ling le khaova hungpang diu chuleh akhonna le Pakai na Pathen uvin napeh nau gampha laija konna delmanga nahung um diu ahi.   
\p
\v 14 “Vannoi leiset chena dolla keima hi kahung thivah ding ahitai. Pakai na Pathen uvin akitepna jouse nasuh bukimpeh tauvin khatcha jong athonna aumpoi tihi na lungthim'u giltah in nahe uve.  
\v 15 Ahinlah Pakai na Pathen uvin akitepna banga thilpha jouse napeh bang uva hi, athu na ngailou uleh nachung uva hahsatna ahin lhunkhum sah ding ahi. Aman gampha napeh nauva konna hi na suhmang diu ahi.  
\v 16 Nanghon Pakai na Pathen'u kitepna hi nanit lou uva semthu pathen ho nahin hou uva akin nahin bol uva ahileh nangho douna a alunghanna mei hung koujah jeng ding chutengle chun aman napeh nau gam phatah a konna hi na mahthah diu ahi.   
\c 24  
\s1 Pathen Toh Kitepna Kithah Sem  
\p
\v 1 Hiche jou chun Joshua’n Israel phung jouse chu upaho leh lamkai ho chule thutan vaihom ho jouse Shechem'ah anakou khom'in hiti chun amaho ahungun Pathen angsung'ah ahung dingun ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Joshua’n mipi aboncha uva jah a chun hitin ana seije, “Pakai Israel Pathen'in hitin aseije, napului teniu Abraham le Nahor pa Terah chu khanglui laijin Euphrates lui gal'a acheng uvin chujongleh ama hon pathen limsemthu ho jong ana houvun ahi. \x + \xo 24:2 \xt Semtilbu 11:27\x*  
\v 3 Ahinla Keiman napuluiju Abraham chu Euphrate gallam akon chun Canaan gam'a kahin puilutnin ahi. Keiman achapa Isaac a kon'in chilhah tamtah kana pen ahi. \x + \xo 24:3 \xt Semtilbu 12:1-9; \xt Semtilbu 21:1-3\x*  
\v 4 Isaac chu Jacob le Esau kana pen ahi. Esau chu Seir molsang lang chu kana pen, Jacob le achilhah te chu Egypt langa ana chesuh un ahi. \x + \xo 24:4 \xt Semtilbu 25:24-26; \xt Semtilbu 36:8; Danbu Ni Na 2:5; \xt Semtilbu 46:1-7\x*   
\p
\v 5 Hiche jou chun Keiman Mose le Aaron kana sollin chuleh Egypt achun natset khohtah kana lansah in, hiche jou chun Keiman nangho chu chamlhat mite nahi theina diuvin kahin puidoh un ahi. \x + \xo 24:5 \xt Potdohbu 3:1—12:42\x*  
\v 6 Ahinlah napu napa teu hin Twikhanglen San alhun phat un, Egypt miten Sakol kangtalai jin nahin nungdel tauvin ahi. \x + \xo 24:6 \xt Potdohbu 14:1-31\x*  
\v 7 Hichun napu napa teu chu Pakai kom'a ahung penjah jeng phat un nangho leh Egypt te kikah a thim kana jinsah in, twikhanglen chu kana vallhum sah in, hiti chun na mitmu changtah un Egypt te chunga hitobang hi kana tongdoh in ahi. Hiche jou chun gamthip noijah phat sottah nahung cheng tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Ajona in Keiman nangho chu Jordan pang nisolam'a cheng Amor mite gamsunga kahin puilut un ahi. Ama hon nangho chu nakisatpi uvin ahinlah keiman amaho chu na masang tah uva ka suhmang peh un ahi. Keiman amaho chunga galjona kape uvin hiti chun nang hon agamsungu nalo uvin nachen khum tauvin ahi. \x + \xo 24:8 \xt Minbu 21:21-35\x*  
\v 9 Hiche jou chun Moab lengpa Zippor chapa Balak chun Israel dounan gal ahin bol tan ahi. Aman Beor chapa Balaam chu nangho gaosap dingin ahin kouvin, \x + \xo 24:9 \xt Minbu 22:1—24:25\x*  
\v 10 ahinlah keiman kana noppeh pon, keiman Balaam chu nangho joh phatthei kana bohsah tan, hiti chun nangho chu Balak a kon'in kana huhdoh tan ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Nangho Jordan vadung na galkai uva Jericho nahung lhun phatnun, Amor mite, Periz mite, Canaan mite, Hit mite, Girgash mite, Hivi mite le Jebus miten bang bangun Jericho miten jong na-na dou tauvin ahi. Ahinlah keiman amaho chu kana josah tauve. \x + \xo 24:11 \xt Joshua 3:14-17; \xt Joshua 6:1-21\x*  
\v 12 Keiman Amor leng teni delmang dingin nangho masang’ah khoise kanasol masan ahi. Nagaljo nau chu nachem uleh na thalpiu ahipon ahi. \x + \xo 24:12 \xt Potdohbu 23:28; Danbu Ni Na 7:20\x*  
\v 13 Na thanat nau hilou gam chu kapeuvin chuleh na sahdoh sau hilou khopiho kapeuvin nang hon tun na chenpha tauvin ahi. Natusau hi hih jongleh Olive gammang jong naneh diuvin kapeuvin ahi. \x + \xo 24:13 \xt Danbu Ni Na 6:10,11\x*   
\p
\v 14 “Hijeh chun na lungthim pumpi uvin Pakai chu gingun lang akin bol uvin. Napu napa teuvin Euphrate vadung gallang Egypt a ana chenlai uva ana houvu semthu pathen ho chu a itih a dingin paimang sohhel uvin lang Pakai kin jeng bou bollun.  
\v 15 Ahinlah hiche Pakai kin hi nabol nom louhel uva ahileh koi kin nabol dingu ham tuni hin kilhen khen jeng uvin. Euphrates gallanga napu napateu semthu pathen ho chu nahou joh diu ham? Ahilouleh tua na chennau gamsunga ana chengah Amor mite semthu pathen ho joh chu nahou diu ham kilhen khen tauvin. Keima leh ka insung miten vang a i-tih chan hijongleh Pakai kin chu kabol jing jeng dingu ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 16 Mipi ten hiti hin adonbut uva, “Keihon itih hijongleh Pakai chu nungsun a semthu pathen dang kin kabol louhel diu ahi.  
\v 17 Ajeh chu Pakai I-Pathen'un keiho leh kapu kapateu Egypt gam sohchan na a konna eina huhdoh uva chu ahi. Aman datmo um thil kidang nasatah keiho mitmu tah in ana bollin ahi. Keihon gamthip noiya melmate lah a lam kahin jot nauva hin aman eihin pui galkai uvah ama bou ahi.  
\v 18 Hiche gam'a ana cheng Amor mite leh namdang ho jouse eina nodoh peh uvah Pakai ama bou ahi. Hijeh chun keihon jong ama kin bou kabol diu ahi, ajeh chu ama bou hi ka Pathen'u ahi.”   
\p
\v 19 Hichun Joshua in mipi ho chu agihsallin hitin aseije, “Nanghon Pakai kin hi boljou pouvin nate, ajeh chu Pakai hi thengtah leh thangthip Pathen ahi. Aman na chonset nau leh Ama na douna hou jouse na ngaidam pouvinte.  
\v 20 Ahin nang hon Pakai chu na nungsun uva semthu pathen dang kin nahin bol jeng tah uva ahileh tumasangin nahin ngailulheh jengu jongleh, nangho douva hung pang ding nahin suhmang dingu ahi” ati.   
\p
\v 21 Ahinlah mipi ho chun Joshua chu adonbut un, “Ahipoi keihon Pakai kin chu kabol tei diu ahi” atiuve.   
\p
\v 22 Joshua’n jong aseijin, “Nanghon na thulhuh nau chunga nang ho leh nangho ahettohsah nahiuve, nang hon Pakai kin bol ding nakilhen tauve” ati. Ama hon adonbutnun, “Henge, keihon ka thusei uhi keiho ma-ma ahetoh kahiuve,” atiuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 23 Joshua’n aseijin, “Aphai chuti ahileh nalah uva milim semthu ho chu sumangun lang Pakai na Pathen'u langa chun kiheijun lang nalungthim pumpi peuvin,” ati.   
\p
\v 24 Mipite chun Joshua kom'a aseijun, “Keihon, Pakai I-Pathen'u kin jong kabol diu, ama thujeng bou kangai diu ahi” atiuve.   
\p
\v 25 Hiti chun Joshua’n hiche nikho chun Shechem’ah mipi chutoh kitepna khat ana sem’un Pakai thupeh ho leh adan thupeh ho chu anit diuvin ana kitepsah in ahi.  
\v 26 Joshua’n hiche ho chu Pathen dan lekhabua ana jihlut in ahi. Chuleh hiche hetjingna dinga hin song lentah khat Pakai ponbuh kom gangpi phungnoiya ana tungdoh in ahi.   
\p
\v 27 Joshua’n mipi ho kom'ah ana seije, “Pakaijin eiho kom'a asei jouse chu hiche song hin aja sohkeijin ahi. Nangho Pakaiya nakitep nauva konna nanung chon uva ahileh hiche hi nangho douna a hettohsah hi ding ahi” ati.   
\p
\v 28 Hiche jou chun, Joshua’n mipi ho chu abonchan a inlam cheh a asoldoh tan ahi.   
\s1 Gamtep Gam’a Kivui Lamkai Ho  
\p
\v 29 Hiche jou hin Pakai lhacha Nun chapa Joshua chu kum jakhat le somkhat alhin chun athitan ahi.  
\v 30 Ama hon ama gam chan dinga ana kipehna mun, Gaash Mol sahlang Ephraim thinglhang gam Timnath-serah mun'ah anavui tauvin ahi. \x + \xo 24:30 \xt Joshua 19:49,50\x*   
\p
\v 31 Israel mipi te chun Joshua hinlaisen chuleh Pakaijin Israel te dinga anabol ho jouse atahsa tah a hin hechen Joshua thinunga hing nalai upaho hinlai sungsen Pakai kin phatah in ahin bol'un ahi.   
\p
\v 32 Israel ten Egypt ahin dalhah uva ahinpoh u Joseph gu ho chu, Jacob in Hamor chatea konna dangka 100 a ana choh gamsung Shechem mun a chun ana vuiyun ahi. Hiche gam hi Joseph chilhah ho chan dinga ana kipe gamsunga chu uma ahi. \x + \xo 24:32 \xt Semtilbu 33:19; 50:24,25; Potdohbu 13:19; Jn 4:5; Act 7:16\x*   
\p
\v 33 Aaron chapa Eleazer athitai. Ama chu achapa Phinehas ana kipe Gibeah khopi sung Ephraim thinglhang'ah ana vuijun ahi.   